(3459159, 482322, 18219, '<td valign="top">i don''t see much evidence of grain I''m afraid.<br/>and i also don''t see how grain would enhance this picture anyway.<br/>this type of picture is best suited to bright, sharp, crisp clear vibrant colors.<br/>well, that''s what I think anyway :-)</td>', 'i don''t see much evidence of grain I''m afraid.and i also don''t see how grain would enhance this picture anyway.this type of picture is best suited to bright, sharp, crisp clear vibrant colors.well, that''s what I think anyway :-)', '2007-03-14 07:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
