(3459194, 483701, 51793, '<td valign="top">okay I am bit confused in this picture, We have a woman here wearing a class A jacket with what looks like a brown Indiana Jones hat and  what looks like no pants on holding a cat with a tutu on. You have a leopard print pillow and a flower background which doesnt really match. And she''s also holding a bottle of wine instead of the more obvious "liquor" bottle. Wine is for celebrating, liquor is for depression in images. But that is just my 2 cents.</td>', 'okay I am bit confused in this picture, We have a woman here wearing a class A jacket with what looks like a brown Indiana Jones hat and  what looks like no pants on holding a cat with a tutu on. You have a leopard print pillow and a flower background which doesnt really match. And she''s also holding a bottle of wine instead of the more obvious "liquor" bottle. Wine is for celebrating, liquor is for depression in images. But that is just my 2 cents.', '2007-03-14 07:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3459197, 483398, 51793, '<td valign="top">I think this is the first time I have seen this type of border but I really like it. It really brings out the picture and I just really like it, good job</td>', 'I think this is the first time I have seen this type of border but I really like it. It really brings out the picture and I just really like it, good job', '2007-03-14 07:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3459203, 483297, 6999, '<td valign="top">Difficult to strike a balance between the obscuring of detail and the amount of grain, and to second guess the voters on that count; to my eye, you''ve gone a little too far - and perhaps your choice of subject isn''t particularly suited to the style. Although the grain adds some5hing to the sense of texture in the stone, it also, particularly in the sky area, becomes plainly just noise patterns rather than a particular enhancement. For myself, I think I would have tried to fill the frame with this image, which would give the advantage of only affecting the sense of stone.</td>', 'Difficult to strike a balance between the obscuring of detail and the amount of grain, and to second guess the voters on that count; to my eye, you''ve gone a little too far - and perhaps your choice of subject isn''t particularly suited to the style. Although the grain adds some5hing to the sense of texture in the stone, it also, particularly in the sky area, becomes plainly just noise patterns rather than a particular enhancement. For myself, I think I would have tried to fill the frame with this image, which would give the advantage of only affecting the sense of stone.', '2007-03-14 07:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3459208, 484031, 6999, '<td valign="top">I don''t think, for myself, that a bright shiny subject is particularly enhanced by the sense of dirtiness and rough texture that the grain brings to it. The impression one is left with is of an overlay of noise, rather than a co-operative part of the image.</td>', 'I don''t think, for myself, that a bright shiny subject is particularly enhanced by the sense of dirtiness and rough texture that the grain brings to it. The impression one is left with is of an overlay of noise, rather than a co-operative part of the image.', '2007-03-14 07:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3459216, 483568, 75289, '<td valign="top">Er... that looks somewhat terminally out of focus</td>', 'Er... that looks somewhat terminally out of focus', '2007-03-14 07:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3459219, 483600, 75289, '<td valign="top">Try it in low-key as well</td>', 'Try it in low-key as well', '2007-03-14 07:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3459220, 483235, 70661, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite cat picture on DPC.</td>', 'This is my favorite cat picture on DPC.', '2007-03-14 07:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3459222, 481533, 6999, '<td valign="top">Quite a plain image, quite everyday. Perhaps especially in colour. I appreciate your more subtle use of grain/noise, but I''m unsure that this is particularly enhanced by that, and unsure that its a scene/image/composition that will grab many folks'' attention. In a sense, you set yourself an even harder challenge by taking such an ordinary subject.</td>', 'Quite a plain image, quite everyday. Perhaps especially in colour. I appreciate your more subtle use of grain/noise, but I''m unsure that this is particularly enhanced by that, and unsure that its a scene/image/composition that will grab many folks'' attention. In a sense, you set yourself an even harder challenge by taking such an ordinary subject.', '2007-03-14 07:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3459227, 481417, 6999, '<td valign="top">Certainly a mood captured here, and the noise works well with the image, rather than seeming simply overlaid. The difficult balance between detail and grain perhaps lets it down a touch for me - in a sense its neither one thing nor the other - not enough interference to approach the abstract, and yet not enough sense of detailed change of light to approach the realistic.</td>', 'Certainly a mood captured here, and the noise works well with the image, rather than seeming simply overlaid. The difficult balance between detail and grain perhaps lets it down a touch for me - in a sense its neither one thing nor the other - not enough interference to approach the abstract, and yet not enough sense of detailed change of light to approach the realistic.', '2007-03-14 08:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3459236, 483933, 60899, '<td valign="top">Great tones ...</td>', 'Great tones ...', '2007-03-14 08:04:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3459238, 483837, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good use of the technique - the depth of field and tilt to enhance the composition work well. It suffers, for me, from the usual problem with chess shots, of seeming portentously meaningful, freighted with messages, effortfully significant; whilst it actually lacks humanity, both in subject and in sense, I feel. I suspect it''ll score reasonably well.</td>', 'Good use of the technique - the depth of field and tilt to enhance the composition work well. It suffers, for me, from the usual problem with chess shots, of seeming portentously meaningful, freighted with messages, effortfully significant; whilst it actually lacks humanity, both in subject and in sense, I feel. I suspect it''ll score reasonably well.', '2007-03-14 08:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3459271, 483775, 74588, '<td valign="top">it got everything</td>', 'it got everything', '2007-03-14 08:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3459290, 483560, 69698, '<td valign="top">Great shot IMF</td>', 'Great shot IMF', '2007-03-14 08:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3459298, 482476, 6999, '<td valign="top">A kind of confusing image: it has good points, and then strangely poor elements out of keeping with the overall feel of it. The sheer blackness and lack of detail in the brush, and yet the sense of pose in the feet/ankles. The decent light on the shapes of the legs, and the poor reflections on the floor. Why it should seem particularly suited to a grainy look I don''t know. It hints at a film noir contrast and feel, but then presents this very domestic - even if dated - scene. Interesting, but for me, in the end, not quite successful.</td>', 'A kind of confusing image: it has good points, and then strangely poor elements out of keeping with the overall feel of it. The sheer blackness and lack of detail in the brush, and yet the sense of pose in the feet/ankles. The decent light on the shapes of the legs, and the poor reflections on the floor. Why it should seem particularly suited to a grainy look I don''t know. It hints at a film noir contrast and feel, but then presents this very domestic - even if dated - scene. Interesting, but for me, in the end, not quite successful.', '2007-03-14 08:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3459309, 483638, 60899, '<td valign="top">Great shot...i myself was planning to enter something like this...9</td>', 'Great shot...i myself was planning to enter something like this...9', '2007-03-14 08:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3459320, 483010, 6999, '<td valign="top">In such a smooth, almost rendered feeling image, a couple of little detail really bug my eye - the scoop or whatever below the nose, and the highlight on the left ear - particularly against the black background. The bottom left, the body of the mannequin, also makes the image too busy, in what might have been the more effective for being a simple as possible. The sense of grain suits absolutely though - adding a subtlety of texture to what might otherwise have been simply too smooth, too plastic an image. <br/> <br/>It''s perhaps the two lightsources that actually upset the purity of this composition. So simple that any extra confusion makes for unneccesary feeling of addition.</td>', 'In such a smooth, almost rendered feeling image, a couple of little detail really bug my eye - the scoop or whatever below the nose, and the highlight on the left ear - particularly against the black background. The bottom left, the body of the mannequin, also makes the image too busy, in what might have been the more effective for being a simple as possible. The sense of grain suits absolutely though - adding a subtlety of texture to what might otherwise have been simply too smooth, too plastic an image.  It''s perhaps the two lightsources that actually upset the purity of this composition. So simple that any extra confusion makes for unneccesary feeling of addition.', '2007-03-14 08:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3459321, 481721, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice story-suggesting image.  Good work indeed. 8.</td>', 'Nice story-suggesting image.  Good work indeed. 8.', '2007-03-14 08:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3459324, 482217, 51538, '<td valign="top">A good idea which gains with the noise addition. 7.</td>', 'A good idea which gains with the noise addition. 7.', '2007-03-14 08:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3459326, 483914, 51538, '<td valign="top">Subtle and pretty.  It would work well with or without noise. 7.</td>', 'Subtle and pretty.  It would work well with or without noise. 7.', '2007-03-14 08:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3459327, 483012, 6999, '<td valign="top">Extraordinary image - but you''ll be hammered for entering it in this challenge I fear. make it black and white, too - it will emphasise the sense of motion without the distraction of the colours.</td>', 'Extraordinary image - but you''ll be hammered for entering it in this challenge I fear. make it black and white, too - it will emphasise the sense of motion without the distraction of the colours.', '2007-03-14 08:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
