(3459343, 483762, 31443, '<td valign="top">Very strange image, I like it a lot but cannot figure out what it is, a reflection from a shop window? Another dress hanging outside the building? Interesting and yes, the grain fits nicely here..</td>', 'Very strange image, I like it a lot but cannot figure out what it is, a reflection from a shop window? Another dress hanging outside the building? Interesting and yes, the grain fits nicely here..', '2007-03-14 08:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
