(3459442, 483394, 18349, '<td valign="top">Powerful, emotive, well-composed, and perfect for this challenge.  I have looked at all the thumbnails and this is the strongest image in the challenge, IMHO.  My pick for the blue...unfortunately, I''m usually completely off when picking winners.  I hope I don''t jinx you because this is a standout shot.  Congrats.</td>', 'Powerful, emotive, well-composed, and perfect for this challenge.  I have looked at all the thumbnails and this is the strongest image in the challenge, IMHO.  My pick for the blue...unfortunately, I''m usually completely off when picking winners.  I hope I don''t jinx you because this is a standout shot.  Congrats.', '2007-03-14 08:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
