(3459636, 483684, 66201, '<td valign="top">Intriguing - a little bit melodramatic, but lovely centrality and use of natural light - great fan of natural light!!!</td>', 'Intriguing - a little bit melodramatic, but lovely centrality and use of natural light - great fan of natural light!!!', '2007-03-14 09:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3459654, 484011, 35357, '<td valign="top">Bleak &amp; lonely.  I love the lines &amp; the way the light falls to the platform.  Without the tilt this would be a more ordinary shot, the tilt adds a dynamic feel.  Grain in colour usually hurts my eyes, but you''ve got it just right here.  Wonderful shot!</td>', 'Bleak & lonely.  I love the lines & the way the light falls to the platform.  Without the tilt this would be a more ordinary shot, the tilt adds a dynamic feel.  Grain in colour usually hurts my eyes, but you''ve got it just right here.  Wonderful shot!', '2007-03-14 09:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
