(3459669, 483643, 35545, '<td valign="top">Nice infant shot, but I can''t see that the grain serves any purpose.  IMO, it detracts from the picture by making his/her face look dirty.  8(</td>', 'Nice infant shot, but I can''t see that the grain serves any purpose.  IMO, it detracts from the picture by making his/her face look dirty.  8(', '2007-03-14 09:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
