(3459790, 483978, 75289, '<td valign="top">The grain parts could be OK in their own right but they don''t seem to sit well with the blown highlights on her dress - it doesn''t say "artistic choice to add grain" so much as it says "failure to reduce contrast with fill-in flash" to me.</td>', 'The grain parts could be OK in their own right but they don''t seem to sit well with the blown highlights on her dress - it doesn''t say "artistic choice to add grain" so much as it says "failure to reduce contrast with fill-in flash" to me.', '2007-03-14 10:19:54.000000', NULL, 1);
