(3461324, 483396, 37756, '<td valign="top">Great use of color, light and grain, to give impact to this photo...9</td>', 'Great use of color, light and grain, to give impact to this photo...9', '2007-03-14 15:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3461384, 481180, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very nice nostalgic feel to this.  Wonderful tone and grain.  Good job of catching the snow as it falls (fast shutter speed).  Only minor complaint from me is the wagon on the back is a bit centered, although it would be hard to change this (moving your position) without screwing everthing else up in the composition.  Looks like some area homes in the near vicinity.  Overall, well done!  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very nice nostalgic feel to this.  Wonderful tone and grain.  Good job of catching the snow as it falls (fast shutter speed).  Only minor complaint from me is the wagon on the back is a bit centered, although it would be hard to change this (moving your position) without screwing everthing else up in the composition.  Looks like some area homes in the near vicinity.  Overall, well done!  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-03-14 15:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3461390, 483828, 30049, '<td valign="top">Now this is going to get some serious "cute" votes going for it.  :D  Good catch, and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Now this is going to get some serious "cute" votes going for it.  :D  Good catch, and good luck in the challenge.', '2007-03-14 15:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
