(3463420, 484003, 67152, '<td valign="top">This is an incredibly awesome message.  The major flaw I see is that the grain/ noise in the photo is a strange color. I pick up some greens and pinks in the grain, making this very important letter looks strange.  <br/> <br/>Edit - I would recommend trying this is B/W and using sepia (coloration of the b/w image) to bring out the old feel of it.</td>', 'This is an incredibly awesome message.  The major flaw I see is that the grain/ noise in the photo is a strange color. I pick up some greens and pinks in the grain, making this very important letter looks strange.   Edit - I would recommend trying this is B/W and using sepia (coloration of the b/w image) to bring out the old feel of it.', '2007-03-15 06:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
