(3464364, 481535, 6999, '<td valign="top">Something compositionally discomforts me here; perhaps that she seems to have no space to move into. Whilst the intriguing bokeh and motion in that background is interesting, she - because of the focus - remains the true subject and you''ve relegated her somewhat. As to the grain ... I''m not sure what it adds to this, why it''s relevant.</td>', 'Something compositionally discomforts me here; perhaps that she seems to have no space to move into. Whilst the intriguing bokeh and motion in that background is interesting, she - because of the focus - remains the true subject and you''ve relegated her somewhat. As to the grain ... I''m not sure what it adds to this, why it''s relevant.', '2007-03-15 14:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
