(3464484, 483933, 60614, '<td valign="top">This photo seems to have a ghost town feel to it because of the gnarled dead trees that are leaning.  The for sale signs are a nice touch.  The grain/noise definately had an impact on this photo with the dark sky.  That really helped give it the eerie deserted feeling.  I love the green tinge that this photo has.  That added to the eerie feeling.</td>', 'This photo seems to have a ghost town feel to it because of the gnarled dead trees that are leaning.  The for sale signs are a nice touch.  The grain/noise definately had an impact on this photo with the dark sky.  That really helped give it the eerie deserted feeling.  I love the green tinge that this photo has.  That added to the eerie feeling.', '2007-03-15 15:32:43.000000', NULL, 1),
