(3466290, 483562, 49109, '<td valign="top">excellent shot, good composition, very detailed, good color and tones, but I really miss noise or grain - the border doesn''t do it. added as fav, though.</td>', 'excellent shot, good composition, very detailed, good color and tones, but I really miss noise or grain - the border doesn''t do it. added as fav, though.', '2007-03-16 10:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
