(3466334, 482642, 43400, '<td valign="top">good nostalgic image and tones--like an old polaroid. the grain works well here.</td>', 'good nostalgic image and tones--like an old polaroid. the grain works well here.', '2007-03-16 11:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3466340, 483266, 43400, '<td valign="top">good capture and story.</td>', 'good capture and story.', '2007-03-16 11:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3466349, 483200, 49109, '<td valign="top">good picture, but the border kills it</td>', 'good picture, but the border kills it', '2007-03-16 11:13:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3466352, 482426, 43400, '<td valign="top">interesting composition and subject. i like the way the trees are depicted. it''s a bit dark and probably needs more brightness and/or contrast, making darks darker and whites whiter.</td>', 'interesting composition and subject. i like the way the trees are depicted. it''s a bit dark and probably needs more brightness and/or contrast, making darks darker and whites whiter.', '2007-03-16 11:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3466354, 484001, 46870, '<td valign="top">Great shot , hope for bule :) 10</td>', 'Great shot , hope for bule :) 10', '2007-03-16 11:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3466364, 483653, 35545, '<td valign="top">Sorry.  I just don''t see that the grain adds anything to this picture.  If anything it obliterates details.</td>', 'Sorry.  I just don''t see that the grain adds anything to this picture.  If anything it obliterates details.', '2007-03-16 11:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3466366, 482642, 35545, '<td valign="top">Needs more contrast.</td>', 'Needs more contrast.', '2007-03-16 11:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3466370, 483299, 35545, '<td valign="top">Too dark.  If there''s grain there, I can''t see it.</td>', 'Too dark.  If there''s grain there, I can''t see it.', '2007-03-16 11:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3466373, 481657, 35545, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I just don''t go for the colored confetti type grain.</td>', 'Sorry, I just don''t go for the colored confetti type grain.', '2007-03-16 11:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3466374, 483634, 46870, '<td valign="top">nice shot</td>', 'nice shot', '2007-03-16 11:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3466386, 481950, 35545, '<td valign="top">Grain is OK, but I just don''t go for the colored confetti effect.</td>', 'Grain is OK, but I just don''t go for the colored confetti effect.', '2007-03-16 11:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3466388, 482186, 35545, '<td valign="top">Good use of grain, but it''s hard to pick out the building from the background.</td>', 'Good use of grain, but it''s hard to pick out the building from the background.', '2007-03-16 11:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3466394, 480993, 44728, '<td valign="top">Nice clouds and texture''s :)</td>', 'Nice clouds and texture''s :)', '2007-03-16 11:35:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3466397, 481818, 22748, '<td valign="top">Really nice; I like how he is looking off camera... it''s sort of a contemplative look. The grain texture is pleasant... is it added in post or is it from high ISO? I''ll be interested to find out.</td>', 'Really nice; I like how he is looking off camera... it''s sort of a contemplative look. The grain texture is pleasant... is it added in post or is it from high ISO? I''ll be interested to find out.', '2007-03-16 11:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3466401, 483979, 22748, '<td valign="top">Awesome lighting!!! I love the composition and the perspective you chose. The grain is nice though I think the very heavy concentration of grain in the shadows may not be best, I might prefer less noise in the shadows and the same level or more in the midtones/highlights: more film-like, IMHO. (But if this is digital sensor noise then obviously there''s nothing you can do about it.) Still a great image... one to the best.</td>', 'Awesome lighting!!! I love the composition and the perspective you chose. The grain is nice though I think the very heavy concentration of grain in the shadows may not be best, I might prefer less noise in the shadows and the same level or more in the midtones/highlights: more film-like, IMHO. (But if this is digital sensor noise then obviously there''s nothing you can do about it.) Still a great image... one to the best.', '2007-03-16 11:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3466405, 481654, 22748, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous!! I love the rays of light with the opera house silhouetted. Is the grain from digital sensor noise? It is some of the more attractive sensor noise I''ve seen. (very fine-grained and evenly distributed with no banding or patchiness).</td>', 'Gorgeous!! I love the rays of light with the opera house silhouetted. Is the grain from digital sensor noise? It is some of the more attractive sensor noise I''ve seen. (very fine-grained and evenly distributed with no banding or patchiness).', '2007-03-16 11:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3466412, 482989, 22748, '<td valign="top">Who! I think I see an image in all that noise... It is an interesting effect, though, a very impressionistic use of grain.</td>', 'Who! I think I see an image in all that noise... It is an interesting effect, though, a very impressionistic use of grain.', '2007-03-16 11:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3466418, 484010, 22748, '<td valign="top">Really doesn''t seem like image grain, but more like a patchy oil-painterly look, as if the image resolution was upsampled way too much with some resizing tool or an effects filter was applied too much. It is a good composition, however, but I am too distracted by the odd texture of the image.</td>', 'Really doesn''t seem like image grain, but more like a patchy oil-painterly look, as if the image resolution was upsampled way too much with some resizing tool or an effects filter was applied too much. It is a good composition, however, but I am too distracted by the odd texture of the image.', '2007-03-16 11:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3466428, 482198, 32644, '<td valign="top">This horse is falling over. Hmm...</td>', 'This horse is falling over. Hmm...', '2007-03-16 11:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3466442, 483974, 50695, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, but the grain looks added on.</td>', 'Nice picture, but the grain looks added on.', '2007-03-16 12:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3466443, 483925, 50695, '<td valign="top">Interesting. I can''t quite figure out what that dark shape conveys. I think the grain is helpful in this case, adds some mood and mystery. 7</td>', 'Interesting. I can''t quite figure out what that dark shape conveys. I think the grain is helpful in this case, adds some mood and mystery. 7', '2007-03-16 12:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3466444, 483610, 50695, '<td valign="top">love the artwork! not sure what the photo is adding...</td>', 'love the artwork! not sure what the photo is adding...', '2007-03-16 12:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3466445, 483634, 50695, '<td valign="top">fog + grain is working well for you. 7</td>', 'fog + grain is working well for you. 7', '2007-03-16 12:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3466448, 480608, 50695, '<td valign="top">The grain makes this shot. 7</td>', 'The grain makes this shot. 7', '2007-03-16 12:18:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3466455, 483623, 50695, '<td valign="top">the grain obscures this and makes it more mysterious and interesting. It''s hard to know where one thing stops and another begins. 8</td>', 'the grain obscures this and makes it more mysterious and interesting. It''s hard to know where one thing stops and another begins. 8', '2007-03-16 12:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3466456, 483811, 50695, '<td valign="top">this probably would look at least as good without grain, but it looks pretty durn good with it. 8</td>', 'this probably would look at least as good without grain, but it looks pretty durn good with it. 8', '2007-03-16 12:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3466458, 483965, 23394, '<td valign="top">excellent<br/> <br/>alt title: built to last</td>', 'excellent alt title: built to last', '2007-03-16 12:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3466459, 483658, 23394, '<td valign="top">what''s that funny looking thing on the lens?</td>', 'what''s that funny looking thing on the lens?', '2007-03-16 12:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3466460, 483790, 50695, '<td valign="top">way to push the grain! delicious composition. 9</td>', 'way to push the grain! delicious composition. 9', '2007-03-16 12:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3466465, 483012, 50695, '<td valign="top">Fantastic. Favorite. I love you and it and the world. I knew there was a reason I slog through DPC every day. 10</td>', 'Fantastic. Favorite. I love you and it and the world. I knew there was a reason I slog through DPC every day. 10', '2007-03-16 12:26:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3466471, 483978, 23394, '<td valign="top">obviously shot by an under-equipped wannabee</td>', 'obviously shot by an under-equipped wannabee', '2007-03-16 12:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3466480, 483599, 49109, '<td valign="top">the grain and the excellent colors make something unusual out of the usual, looks like a painting</td>', 'the grain and the excellent colors make something unusual out of the usual, looks like a painting', '2007-03-16 12:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3466502, 483378, 32644, '<td valign="top">Very cool! I can''t even see where you are hiding.</td>', 'Very cool! I can''t even see where you are hiding.', '2007-03-16 12:52:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3466528, 480626, 32754, '<td valign="top">Powerful and moving image enhanced by the grain..the hand on the rope is emotive and draws the eye...9</td>', 'Powerful and moving image enhanced by the grain..the hand on the rope is emotive and draws the eye...9', '2007-03-16 13:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3466598, 482514, 41047, '<td valign="top">love the composition. one of my favourites in this challenge- bumping up to 10.</td>', 'love the composition. one of my favourites in this challenge- bumping up to 10.', '2007-03-16 13:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3466600, 483841, 41047, '<td valign="top">beautiful composition. really love this, bumping up to 10.</td>', 'beautiful composition. really love this, bumping up to 10.', '2007-03-16 13:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3466622, 480683, 51538, '<td valign="top">A very good subject for the test in hand.  Nice composition. 9.</td>', 'A very good subject for the test in hand.  Nice composition. 9.', '2007-03-16 14:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
