(3467144, 483852, 36999, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of Seurat.  Both the colors and the texture.  Seems to have a little horizon tilt (left is lower to me)  I''m not a big score killer b/c of crooked horizons, I know they can be deceiving.  Very nice image, overall.</td>', 'Reminds me of Seurat.  Both the colors and the texture.  Seems to have a little horizon tilt (left is lower to me)  I''m not a big score killer b/c of crooked horizons, I know they can be deceiving.  Very nice image, overall.', '2007-03-16 18:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3467163, 483764, 61651, '<td valign="top">Effective sense of movement in the image.  Also the 4 people on the left appear focused on the out-thrust arm of the other man, which effectively fixes the viewer''s eyes on the main subject/main source of movement.  The graininess doesn''t detract/distract but adds to the drama of the moment.</td>', 'Effective sense of movement in the image.  Also the 4 people on the left appear focused on the out-thrust arm of the other man, which effectively fixes the viewer''s eyes on the main subject/main source of movement.  The graininess doesn''t detract/distract but adds to the drama of the moment.', '2007-03-16 18:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
