(3467647, 483985, 66597, '<td valign="top">I''m a fan of pointilism, and like that you took this challenge a bit further and moved it into a different realm. Unfortunately, I don''t find enough interest in the subject for it to work for me. Hope you''ll try this with some other subjects - a really great idea.</td>', 'I''m a fan of pointilism, and like that you took this challenge a bit further and moved it into a different realm. Unfortunately, I don''t find enough interest in the subject for it to work for me. Hope you''ll try this with some other subjects - a really great idea.', '2007-03-16 23:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
