(3468053, 483310, 66799, '<td valign="top">something strange, unusual and interesting about the picture</td>', 'something strange, unusual and interesting about the picture', '2007-03-17 07:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3468081, 483200, 34192, '<td valign="top">dislike the border but I like the softness and subtle tones. border is dark enough to distract from and overwhelm the focus of the image so it becomes the focus.  composition and lighting well done.</td>', 'dislike the border but I like the softness and subtle tones. border is dark enough to distract from and overwhelm the focus of the image so it becomes the focus.  composition and lighting well done.', '2007-03-17 08:26:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3468082, 483902, 34192, '<td valign="top">grain may be a little too subtle but the tones in this are excellent.</td>', 'grain may be a little too subtle but the tones in this are excellent.', '2007-03-17 08:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3468083, 483600, 34192, '<td valign="top">grain adds tot he misty feel.  Not sure if I''m convinced by this composition but the tones are well done.</td>', 'grain adds tot he misty feel.  Not sure if I''m convinced by this composition but the tones are well done.', '2007-03-17 08:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3468085, 483124, 34192, '<td valign="top">grain not apparent enough to make an impact on the image.  good picture of a cormorant though.</td>', 'grain not apparent enough to make an impact on the image.  good picture of a cormorant though.', '2007-03-17 08:30:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3468087, 483518, 34192, '<td valign="top">frame overwhelms image - doesn''t leave me enough to see.  Understand selective desat choice though not sure I would have made it.  Grain not strong enough to have impact.</td>', 'frame overwhelms image - doesn''t leave me enough to see.  Understand selective desat choice though not sure I would have made it.  Grain not strong enough to have impact.', '2007-03-17 08:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3468089, 481813, 34192, '<td valign="top">grain gives aged feel.  not too sure about hue used but toning works.  I''m just waiting for something to happen.  There is tension here - you know, it might be due tot he use of yellow.  gotta think on this one a while.</td>', 'grain gives aged feel.  not too sure about hue used but toning works.  I''m just waiting for something to happen.  There is tension here - you know, it might be due tot he use of yellow.  gotta think on this one a while.', '2007-03-17 08:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3468092, 483914, 67404, '<td valign="top">Sweet bird</td>', 'Sweet bird', '2007-03-17 08:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3468095, 483613, 34192, '<td valign="top">with studio type shots it is expected that you have control of everything.  I''m suspecting you may have shot this in a museum type setting so you did not.  But remember to watch for the little things - the wrinkle of the fabric on the right for one.  This could be slightly brighter - the light fades off towards the top and left; with the bright, shiny things at the bottom, it throws off the balance of the image.  A slightly lower point of view might work a little better also, though, since I wasn''t there, I can''t say.  A nice presentation.</td>', 'with studio type shots it is expected that you have control of everything.  I''m suspecting you may have shot this in a museum type setting so you did not.  But remember to watch for the little things - the wrinkle of the fabric on the right for one.  This could be slightly brighter - the light fades off towards the top and left; with the bright, shiny things at the bottom, it throws off the balance of the image.  A slightly lower point of view might work a little better also, though, since I wasn''t there, I can''t say.  A nice presentation.', '2007-03-17 08:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3468096, 483750, 72714, '<td valign="top">To be honest, on my LCD screen, I don''t see much grain at all. I like the idea of the photo though but perhaps being able to see a ball gliding down the alley or slamming into the pins would have added more interest. At the moment, I see a young lady looking down a bowling lane but cannot see what she is looking at.</td>', 'To be honest, on my LCD screen, I don''t see much grain at all. I like the idea of the photo though but perhaps being able to see a ball gliding down the alley or slamming into the pins would have added more interest. At the moment, I see a young lady looking down a bowling lane but cannot see what she is looking at.', '2007-03-17 08:40:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3468100, 483795, 72714, '<td valign="top">I love the grain and shallow depth of field but would have preferred to see the cats head. Good thinking on the title!</td>', 'I love the grain and shallow depth of field but would have preferred to see the cats head. Good thinking on the title!', '2007-03-17 08:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3468101, 483010, 34192, '<td valign="top">title weak but image is great.  Grain really works with presentation.  Tones well rendered.  Composition interesting.</td>', 'title weak but image is great.  Grain really works with presentation.  Tones well rendered.  Composition interesting.', '2007-03-17 08:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3468105, 483852, 72714, '<td valign="top">Personally, I don''t usually like colour with grain, but this one works really well with the blue and purple hues. I would suggest a shift in the horizon though, either higher or lower, depending on whether the sky or foreground was the most interesting as I feel it is too close to the centre of the photo.</td>', 'Personally, I don''t usually like colour with grain, but this one works really well with the blue and purple hues. I would suggest a shift in the horizon though, either higher or lower, depending on whether the sky or foreground was the most interesting as I feel it is too close to the centre of the photo.', '2007-03-17 08:44:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3468108, 481209, 72714, '<td valign="top">I like the tight crop and the eyes staring straight into the lens, almost defiantly. Would have liked to see more grain but I think the tonal range is good.</td>', 'I like the tight crop and the eyes staring straight into the lens, almost defiantly. Would have liked to see more grain but I think the tonal range is good.', '2007-03-17 08:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3468110, 482642, 72714, '<td valign="top">Good grain and subject matter but imo the image does not have a good tonal range and feels a bit washed out.</td>', 'Good grain and subject matter but imo the image does not have a good tonal range and feels a bit washed out.', '2007-03-17 08:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3468112, 483814, 72714, '<td valign="top">I really love this picture but for this challenge, I feel the grain is not evident enough. The only areas where I can see real grain is around the lights. The composition is excellent though as is the tonal range. Well photographed!</td>', 'I really love this picture but for this challenge, I feel the grain is not evident enough. The only areas where I can see real grain is around the lights. The composition is excellent though as is the tonal range. Well photographed!', '2007-03-17 08:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3468119, 481374, 72714, '<td valign="top">For me, the crop on this photo feels a bit tight, especially only including half of the wall in the front. Maybe you should have demolished the wall in front alltogether. Lol. Sure no-one would have noticed! The grain is good though and suits the subject matter although there are some blown out highlights on the bottom left and on the ''chimney''.</td>', 'For me, the crop on this photo feels a bit tight, especially only including half of the wall in the front. Maybe you should have demolished the wall in front alltogether. Lol. Sure no-one would have noticed! The grain is good though and suits the subject matter although there are some blown out highlights on the bottom left and on the ''chimney''.', '2007-03-17 08:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3468124, 482609, 72714, '<td valign="top">I like the mood created by the colours and grain but would have preferred to see someone walking ''into'' the scene on the left rather than ''out'' on the right hand side. I feel including the sidewalk would also have improved the photo.</td>', 'I like the mood created by the colours and grain but would have preferred to see someone walking ''into'' the scene on the left rather than ''out'' on the right hand side. I feel including the sidewalk would also have improved the photo.', '2007-03-17 08:56:19.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3468127, 483870, 73250, '<td valign="top">It''s a very nice candid...but, you lost a lot in the blown out whites and the top of the image is a bit distracting.</td>', 'It''s a very nice candid...but, you lost a lot in the blown out whites and the top of the image is a bit distracting.', '2007-03-17 08:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3468128, 483430, 72714, '<td valign="top">I like the tight crop on this photo and the grain adds to mood perfectly. It has great tonal range and the pensive/scheming/wicked/day dreaming look on the subjects face just makes this a fantastic photo. Well photographed.</td>', 'I like the tight crop on this photo and the grain adds to mood perfectly. It has great tonal range and the pensive/scheming/wicked/day dreaming look on the subjects face just makes this a fantastic photo. Well photographed.', '2007-03-17 09:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3468129, 481374, 73250, '<td valign="top">The top and right sides are too closely cropped. There really is no point of interest...the fence blocks your subject.</td>', 'The top and right sides are too closely cropped. There really is no point of interest...the fence blocks your subject.', '2007-03-17 09:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3468131, 482995, 73250, '<td valign="top">Nice texture and shadows.</td>', 'Nice texture and shadows.', '2007-03-17 09:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3468133, 480727, 73250, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition and the duotone suits it.</td>', 'Very nice composition and the duotone suits it.', '2007-03-17 09:03:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3468135, 482413, 72714, '<td valign="top">Great action shot! The blue hue makes the water seem really cold but I''m not too sure if I like it. I would like to see this photo in b&amp;w to decide. Nevertheless, it is still a great shot!</td>', 'Great action shot! The blue hue makes the water seem really cold but I''m not too sure if I like it. I would like to see this photo in b&w to decide. Nevertheless, it is still a great shot!', '2007-03-17 09:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3468137, 481978, 73250, '<td valign="top">Nicely done...the grainy effect suits it.</td>', 'Nicely done...the grainy effect suits it.', '2007-03-17 09:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3468141, 480608, 73250, '<td valign="top">Very nice still life.</td>', 'Very nice still life.', '2007-03-17 09:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3468152, 481535, 72714, '<td valign="top">I think this is an amazing image! I like the placement of the main subject in the bottom right corner and the blue/red colour scheme. The out of focus, people in the background have an impressionist/painterly feel which I find really beautiful. It would be interesting to see this photo without the grain and maybe in b&amp;w, although I think losing the blues and reds would actually detract from the photo. This is one of those images I could look at again and again. There is actually a great impressionist image ''lurking'' in the top of this photo. Just thinking, if you cropped just under the skates of the man with the blue jumper around his waist, then cloned out the girls head and the ''half'' man on the right......hmmmmm.</td>', 'I think this is an amazing image! I like the placement of the main subject in the bottom right corner and the blue/red colour scheme. The out of focus, people in the background have an impressionist/painterly feel which I find really beautiful. It would be interesting to see this photo without the grain and maybe in b&w, although I think losing the blues and reds would actually detract from the photo. This is one of those images I could look at again and again. There is actually a great impressionist image ''lurking'' in the top of this photo. Just thinking, if you cropped just under the skates of the man with the blue jumper around his waist, then cloned out the girls head and the ''half'' man on the right......hmmmmm.', '2007-03-17 09:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3468154, 482221, 73250, '<td valign="top">I like the duotone...but, it''s a bit too dark/heavy on the bottom.</td>', 'I like the duotone...but, it''s a bit too dark/heavy on the bottom.', '2007-03-17 09:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3468155, 483923, 72714, '<td valign="top">This is a fantastic photo but imo would look better with no grain. At the moment, the grain is too similar to the texture of the fur and I feel, adds nothing to the photo. Great composition though, especially the way he is looking over his shoulder at the camera.</td>', 'This is a fantastic photo but imo would look better with no grain. At the moment, the grain is too similar to the texture of the fur and I feel, adds nothing to the photo. Great composition though, especially the way he is looking over his shoulder at the camera.', '2007-03-17 09:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3468162, 484018, 72714, '<td valign="top">Awwwwww, poor little guy! This monster used to live under my bed, I know how he feels! Great photo! The grain adds to the mood perfectly and I especially love the way the little guy is gripping the edge of the bed. Hope he got a chocolate after this!</td>', 'Awwwwww, poor little guy! This monster used to live under my bed, I know how he feels! Great photo! The grain adds to the mood perfectly and I especially love the way the little guy is gripping the edge of the bed. Hope he got a chocolate after this!', '2007-03-17 09:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3468164, 483790, 72714, '<td valign="top">Great composition although maybe including a little more of the hand, say to the wrist, would have been better as it would have defined the shape of the hand better. Not too sure about so much grain though.</td>', 'Great composition although maybe including a little more of the hand, say to the wrist, would have been better as it would have defined the shape of the hand better. Not too sure about so much grain though.', '2007-03-17 09:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
