(3468554, 481671, 68035, '<td valign="top">Stunning image.  Not 100% sure about the fact that you have some colour in the shot and the grain means that the trees on the left lose distinctiness about 3/4''s of the way up the bank, but regardless of this this remains a pic I would love to have taken</td>', 'Stunning image.  Not 100% sure about the fact that you have some colour in the shot and the grain means that the trees on the left lose distinctiness about 3/4''s of the way up the bank, but regardless of this this remains a pic I would love to have taken', '2007-03-17 14:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3468562, 480746, 7778, '<td valign="top">Considering how unconventionally high the horizon, with the bold silhouetted figure also placed in the upper half of the image, the rocks interfere with a phenomenal potential of a simple and powerful composition, which would be perfectly balanced without it.<br/> <br/>The ferry, while compositionally redundant, makes for a fine metaphor as appears in the same pure white as the sand grounding the man, whose foot prints lead to anyone looking. The same can be said about the horizon intersecting with the subject''s head: it actually aids the metaphor.<br/> <br/>A wonderful image, really, full of sweet ache and tension, spanning several miles and then some: an easy favourite.</td>', 'Considering how unconventionally high the horizon, with the bold silhouetted figure also placed in the upper half of the image, the rocks interfere with a phenomenal potential of a simple and powerful composition, which would be perfectly balanced without it. The ferry, while compositionally redundant, makes for a fine metaphor as appears in the same pure white as the sand grounding the man, whose foot prints lead to anyone looking. The same can be said about the horizon intersecting with the subject''s head: it actually aids the metaphor. A wonderful image, really, full of sweet ache and tension, spanning several miles and then some: an easy favourite.', '2007-03-17 14:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3468563, 483684, 68035, '<td valign="top">Outstanding grain shot.  Nicely framed (although one very minor point would have to been having the child on the left holding her fathers hand to maintain the symmetry of the rest of the frame</td>', 'Outstanding grain shot.  Nicely framed (although one very minor point would have to been having the child on the left holding her fathers hand to maintain the symmetry of the rest of the frame', '2007-03-17 14:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
