(3469270, 483643, 63398, '<td valign="top">Haunting and intense.</td>', 'Haunting and intense.', '2007-03-17 23:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469273, 482177, 63398, '<td valign="top">This is extremely interesting especially since I can''t figure out what it is and I know machinery of all types. I really like the processing, the hues, and the terrific use of grain over what looks like tone-mapping. An exquisite offering! 8</td>', 'This is extremely interesting especially since I can''t figure out what it is and I know machinery of all types. I really like the processing, the hues, and the terrific use of grain over what looks like tone-mapping. An exquisite offering! 8', '2007-03-18 00:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469436, 480824, 72714, '<td valign="top">Some of the highlights seem a bit blown out but I like this photograph anyway. The figure is well placed on the pathway, which leads you into the picture and I like the way the shadow stretches towards the bottom left corner, filling a part of the frame which would have been rather empty otherwise.</td>', 'Some of the highlights seem a bit blown out but I like this photograph anyway. The figure is well placed on the pathway, which leads you into the picture and I like the way the shadow stretches towards the bottom left corner, filling a part of the frame which would have been rather empty otherwise.', '2007-03-18 04:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469437, 483930, 72714, '<td valign="top">Pity there weren''t some nice clouds in this photo but we can''t just ''order'' these things can we? Good positioning of the horizon and the lighthouse though and I think the subject suits the grainy texture well.</td>', 'Pity there weren''t some nice clouds in this photo but we can''t just ''order'' these things can we? Good positioning of the horizon and the lighthouse though and I think the subject suits the grainy texture well.', '2007-03-18 04:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469439, 483843, 72714, '<td valign="top">This could have worked well were it not for the extremely bright foreground and the top left hand side of the image. The highlights are blown out and have lost most of the detail. I like the subject matter though and the shadow ont he right of the bowl which creates depth.</td>', 'This could have worked well were it not for the extremely bright foreground and the top left hand side of the image. The highlights are blown out and have lost most of the detail. I like the subject matter though and the shadow ont he right of the bowl which creates depth.', '2007-03-18 04:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469446, 483889, 72714, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful picture. I am particularly a fan of leading lines and the fence does this really well, while adding interest with the texture at the same time. The trees also add interest to the horizon which would have been bland without them. On the other hand, I don''t think this is the best picture for grain as the impact of the grain tends to get lost in the texture of the grass, fence and trees. Still, well spotted and photographed.</td>', 'This is a wonderful picture. I am particularly a fan of leading lines and the fence does this really well, while adding interest with the texture at the same time. The trees also add interest to the horizon which would have been bland without them. On the other hand, I don''t think this is the best picture for grain as the impact of the grain tends to get lost in the texture of the grass, fence and trees. Still, well spotted and photographed.', '2007-03-18 04:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469480, 483875, 72714, '<td valign="top">Although most of the grain is lost in this shot except in the sky, I think it is still a great photo. The grain in the sky adds to the moodiness of the heavy clouds and the dark line of trees.</td>', 'Although most of the grain is lost in this shot except in the sky, I think it is still a great photo. The grain in the sky adds to the moodiness of the heavy clouds and the dark line of trees.', '2007-03-18 05:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469483, 481664, 72714, '<td valign="top">I like the colours in this photograph and the sunlight caught on the top of the main door. It definately shows urban decay but with regards to the challenge, I don''t see much evidence of grain.</td>', 'I like the colours in this photograph and the sunlight caught on the top of the main door. It definately shows urban decay but with regards to the challenge, I don''t see much evidence of grain.', '2007-03-18 05:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469485, 483658, 72714, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot! The photographers right arm is perfectly placed to frame both the photograph and his face and I like the space you have left in front of the lens. The grain is the perfect touch for this kind of photograph. Well done.</td>', 'This is a great shot! The photographers right arm is perfectly placed to frame both the photograph and his face and I like the space you have left in front of the lens. The grain is the perfect touch for this kind of photograph. Well done.', '2007-03-18 05:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469487, 481722, 72714, '<td valign="top">I like this shot but I''m not too sure about the position of the old man. I do like the light behind his head and his hand but seating him to one side, perhaps at a table would have shown more of his surroundings and made him look more at ease. On the other hand posing him in such a confrontational pose, makes ME feel uncomfortable and therefore evokes an emotion in me, which is what I think makes a good photograph. The addition of grain adds to the mood and is wonderful.</td>', 'I like this shot but I''m not too sure about the position of the old man. I do like the light behind his head and his hand but seating him to one side, perhaps at a table would have shown more of his surroundings and made him look more at ease. On the other hand posing him in such a confrontational pose, makes ME feel uncomfortable and therefore evokes an emotion in me, which is what I think makes a good photograph. The addition of grain adds to the mood and is wonderful.', '2007-03-18 05:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469490, 482514, 72714, '<td valign="top">Fantastic view point! I like the fact that the subject on the left is placed at the top of the photo with empty space below and the two subjects on the right are exactly the opposite.</td>', 'Fantastic view point! I like the fact that the subject on the left is placed at the top of the photo with empty space below and the two subjects on the right are exactly the opposite.', '2007-03-18 05:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469491, 481978, 72714, '<td valign="top">Great mood, very desolate and foreboding! I like the symmetry and the grain is perfect for this type of photo. One small comment, the blown out pillar on the right is a bit distracting.</td>', 'Great mood, very desolate and foreboding! I like the symmetry and the grain is perfect for this type of photo. One small comment, the blown out pillar on the right is a bit distracting.', '2007-03-18 05:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469492, 483031, 72714, '<td valign="top">I don''t particularly like colour with grain, but this shot is pretty minimalist and works well. The grain especially adds to the mood of the layered silhouettes (spelling?) at the bottom of the photo.</td>', 'I don''t particularly like colour with grain, but this shot is pretty minimalist and works well. The grain especially adds to the mood of the layered silhouettes (spelling?) at the bottom of the photo.', '2007-03-18 05:38:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469493, 482326, 72714, '<td valign="top">A lovely shot and I know you meant the horizon to be at that angle, but that is one thing I would change. The photo is striking enough without having to position it at an angle. The bow of the ship seems as though it is going to shoot right out of the frame and the ropes leading in from the bottom right take you straight to the subject. The lines, clouds, and moody grain in this photo are excellent.</td>', 'A lovely shot and I know you meant the horizon to be at that angle, but that is one thing I would change. The photo is striking enough without having to position it at an angle. The bow of the ship seems as though it is going to shoot right out of the frame and the ropes leading in from the bottom right take you straight to the subject. The lines, clouds, and moody grain in this photo are excellent.', '2007-03-18 05:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469498, 483720, 69183, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, but I don''t see any graininess</td>', 'Nice photo, but I don''t see any graininess', '2007-03-18 05:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469499, 481333, 69183, '<td valign="top">The sky is quite good - possibly a bit blown out near the sun, but the rest of the street is too dark and not really grainy.</td>', 'The sky is quite good - possibly a bit blown out near the sun, but the rest of the street is too dark and not really grainy.', '2007-03-18 05:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469500, 482989, 69183, '<td valign="top">This is so grainy I can''t work out what the subject is. The grain doesn''t add to the impact of the photo, if anything it takes away from it.</td>', 'This is so grainy I can''t work out what the subject is. The grain doesn''t add to the impact of the photo, if anything it takes away from it.', '2007-03-18 05:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469502, 483668, 69183, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, not grainy.</td>', 'Nice shot, not grainy.', '2007-03-18 05:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469504, 483124, 69183, '<td valign="top">Lovely image, but not grainy. I suspect you''ll get a few DNMCs for this, which is a shange because it''s a great shot.</td>', 'Lovely image, but not grainy. I suspect you''ll get a few DNMCs for this, which is a shange because it''s a great shot.', '2007-03-18 05:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469511, 480746, 69183, '<td valign="top">Maybe a small complaint, bit I think it''s a pity about the extra sets of footprints in the sand. It''d be that much better if there was only the one set, like the guy had walked somewhere secluded to watch the ship disappearing. 8.</td>', 'Maybe a small complaint, bit I think it''s a pity about the extra sets of footprints in the sand. It''d be that much better if there was only the one set, like the guy had walked somewhere secluded to watch the ship disappearing. 8.', '2007-03-18 06:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469520, 483587, 69183, '<td valign="top">This is too grainy for me - too much of the detail is lost and the grain is too uniform to add anything to the shot. I don''t like the way the top of the head is cropped off either - sorry</td>', 'This is too grainy for me - too much of the detail is lost and the grain is too uniform to add anything to the shot. I don''t like the way the top of the head is cropped off either - sorry', '2007-03-18 06:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469524, 482221, 69183, '<td valign="top">Not a bad shot, but could have been better if the headstone in the bottom right wasn''t obscuring the very corner of the building.</td>', 'Not a bad shot, but could have been better if the headstone in the bottom right wasn''t obscuring the very corner of the building.', '2007-03-18 06:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469531, 482009, 69183, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Next time, use the max 640px resolution and 150kb size you''re allowed - it will give the shot that much more impact, and people get very used to looking at shots of a particular size. When yours is much smaller, it''ll lose out.</td>', 'Nice shot. Next time, use the max 640px resolution and 150kb size you''re allowed - it will give the shot that much more impact, and people get very used to looking at shots of a particular size. When yours is much smaller, it''ll lose out.', '2007-03-18 06:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469535, 483520, 23394, '<td valign="top">too centered to realize its full potential.  either more behind or in front to help tell her story: is she trapped, shy, longing to go outside but afraid to, unable to.  or is she simply day-dreaming?  lots of possibilities here, just need to work on the composition.</td>', 'too centered to realize its full potential.  either more behind or in front to help tell her story: is she trapped, shy, longing to go outside but afraid to, unable to.  or is she simply day-dreaming?  lots of possibilities here, just need to work on the composition.', '2007-03-18 06:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469543, 484018, 23394, '<td valign="top">it works for me, can''t imagine why it''s connecting with everyone else.  maybe you picked the wrong tone.</td>', 'it works for me, can''t imagine why it''s connecting with everyone else.  maybe you picked the wrong tone.', '2007-03-18 06:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469546, 482123, 23394, '<td valign="top">you know, under basic editing you <i>can</i> edit out sensor dust...</td>', 'you know, under basic editing you can edit out sensor dust...', '2007-03-18 06:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469548, 483853, 23394, '<td valign="top">i found yours, can you find mine ;-)</td>', 'i found yours, can you find mine ;-)', '2007-03-18 06:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469550, 483562, 69368, '<td valign="top">exellent! -10 - My favorite!</td>', 'exellent! -10 - My favorite!', '2007-03-18 06:47:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469551, 483314, 23394, '<td valign="top">brilliant, in an aznymy kinda way!</td>', 'brilliant, in an aznymy kinda way!', '2007-03-18 06:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469565, 483988, 48228, '<td valign="top">Awesome portrait mate.....love it.....</td>', 'Awesome portrait mate.....love it.....', '2007-03-18 07:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469573, 483235, 65468, '<td valign="top">Great crop and composition.  Titled well and the overall soft grain really adds to the photo.  Grain was well handled in the capture even if it was introduced or part of the take at high ISO.</td>', 'Great crop and composition.  Titled well and the overall soft grain really adds to the photo.  Grain was well handled in the capture even if it was introduced or part of the take at high ISO.', '2007-03-18 07:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469580, 483137, 65468, '<td valign="top">For me this composition is good and I liike the overall softness of the background image and grain but the lack of any sharp focus of the main object to grab the eye is limiting.</td>', 'For me this composition is good and I liike the overall softness of the background image and grain but the lack of any sharp focus of the main object to grab the eye is limiting.', '2007-03-18 07:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469610, 483283, 30982, '<td valign="top">Really like the light and the shadows.</td>', 'Really like the light and the shadows.', '2007-03-18 08:01:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469611, 483634, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is one of those where grain works very well.  The misty aspect is lovely and adds to the concept portrayed by your title.</td>', 'This is one of those where grain works very well.  The misty aspect is lovely and adds to the concept portrayed by your title.', '2007-03-18 08:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469612, 483430, 30982, '<td valign="top">I get mischevous more than wicked from this, but I love the picture just the same.  The grain definitely adds in my opinion.</td>', 'I get mischevous more than wicked from this, but I love the picture just the same.  The grain definitely adds in my opinion.', '2007-03-18 08:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469613, 483611, 30982, '<td valign="top">I don''t know how well this is scoring for you, but I really like this.  A wonderful "in the moment" shot that for some reason just makes me smile!</td>', 'I don''t know how well this is scoring for you, but I really like this.  A wonderful "in the moment" shot that for some reason just makes me smile!', '2007-03-18 08:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469614, 483031, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like how the grain contributes to the creation of essentially two spaces here - the ground, and the sky appear to be two different worlds.</td>', 'I like how the grain contributes to the creation of essentially two spaces here - the ground, and the sky appear to be two different worlds.', '2007-03-18 08:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469638, 481871, 74765, '<td valign="top">The headlight is a litle bit to bright, otherwise a beautiful picture!</td>', 'The headlight is a litle bit to bright, otherwise a beautiful picture!', '2007-03-18 09:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469642, 482465, 74765, '<td valign="top">Imposible to identify the object in the picture. Nice grain!</td>', 'Imposible to identify the object in the picture. Nice grain!', '2007-03-18 09:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469643, 482040, 74765, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, but a litle bit to stale.</td>', 'Nice picture, but a litle bit to stale.', '2007-03-18 09:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469645, 481671, 74765, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, great reflections, but I would like the picture better without the grain.</td>', 'Nice picture, great reflections, but I would like the picture better without the grain.', '2007-03-18 09:06:39.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3469647, 483567, 74765, '<td valign="top">The picture look''s like something scanned one time to much in a club newsletter. It doesn''t tell me anything really.</td>', 'The picture look''s like something scanned one time to much in a club newsletter. It doesn''t tell me anything really.', '2007-03-18 09:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469655, 483600, 74765, '<td valign="top">Why can''t I shoot images like that? Lovely picture!</td>', 'Why can''t I shoot images like that? Lovely picture!', '2007-03-18 09:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469659, 483908, 74765, '<td valign="top">Would like to see this shot in B&amp;W, I believe it would have worked better.</td>', 'Would like to see this shot in B&W, I believe it would have worked better.', '2007-03-18 09:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469662, 483985, 74765, '<td valign="top">To much grain in my opinion.</td>', 'To much grain in my opinion.', '2007-03-18 09:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469666, 480695, 74765, '<td valign="top">I find the frame cutting though the flower very disturbing. The frame in the lower corner works.</td>', 'I find the frame cutting though the flower very disturbing. The frame in the lower corner works.', '2007-03-18 09:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469668, 483582, 74765, '<td valign="top">I believe this picture would have worked better without the reflection or a sharper reflection might have been better. The reflection disturbed me as I didn''t first know if it was a second straw or reflection.</td>', 'I believe this picture would have worked better without the reflection or a sharper reflection might have been better. The reflection disturbed me as I didn''t first know if it was a second straw or reflection.', '2007-03-18 09:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469669, 483809, 74765, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, nice grain but unfotunatley the picture looks a litle bit flat, another angle could have given a more interesting picture. Great potential!</td>', 'Nice colors, nice grain but unfotunatley the picture looks a litle bit flat, another angle could have given a more interesting picture. Great potential!', '2007-03-18 09:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469670, 483562, 74765, '<td valign="top">Great picture!</td>', 'Great picture!', '2007-03-18 09:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469675, 484011, 74765, '<td valign="top">To much tilted for my taste, otherwise great picture.</td>', 'To much tilted for my taste, otherwise great picture.', '2007-03-18 09:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469743, 483925, 31341, '<td valign="top">This has beautiful colors and textures.  The grain is not obvious, though.</td>', 'This has beautiful colors and textures.  The grain is not obvious, though.', '2007-03-18 10:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469745, 482465, 31341, '<td valign="top">I really am having a hard time seeing what this is...</td>', 'I really am having a hard time seeing what this is...', '2007-03-18 10:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469749, 482198, 31341, '<td valign="top">Cool perspective.</td>', 'Cool perspective.', '2007-03-18 10:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469762, 482286, 31341, '<td valign="top">The crooked horizon is distracting to me.</td>', 'The crooked horizon is distracting to me.', '2007-03-18 10:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469769, 484011, 31341, '<td valign="top">I think your tilted perespective has made this a cool image!</td>', 'I think your tilted perespective has made this a cool image!', '2007-03-18 10:48:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469813, 483797, 72714, '<td valign="top">I think this is a really great shot but I think it will look better with some of the empty sky cropped off the top. This will also move the horizon line away from the centre of the photo. Great colour and grain.</td>', 'I think this is a really great shot but I think it will look better with some of the empty sky cropped off the top. This will also move the horizon line away from the centre of the photo. Great colour and grain.', '2007-03-18 11:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469819, 483853, 72714, '<td valign="top">The grain really suits this type of photo and certainly adds to the impact. I love the vertical lines of the buildings behing the car.</td>', 'The grain really suits this type of photo and certainly adds to the impact. I love the vertical lines of the buildings behing the car.', '2007-03-18 11:12:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469831, 483742, 72714, '<td valign="top">The cross is placed too central within the photograph and the overall tones are a bit light. However, I like the subject matter and IMO would suggest the following, if you get the chance to photograph this again: get the camera really close to the ground and shoot upwards to include the canopies of the tall trees. Move the cross either to the left or right of the photo if you are going to keep it the same size, which I think is great as it would give the effect of the cross towering over the viewer. Or use rule of thirds to place it.</td>', 'The cross is placed too central within the photograph and the overall tones are a bit light. However, I like the subject matter and IMO would suggest the following, if you get the chance to photograph this again: get the camera really close to the ground and shoot upwards to include the canopies of the tall trees. Move the cross either to the left or right of the photo if you are going to keep it the same size, which I think is great as it would give the effect of the cross towering over the viewer. Or use rule of thirds to place it.', '2007-03-18 11:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469833, 483568, 72714, '<td valign="top">This looks more like a texture to me than grain, but I might be wrong. The colours of the flower are wonderful against the rich green background but they are placed too central in the frame. I would suggest using rule of thirds to position the flowers.</td>', 'This looks more like a texture to me than grain, but I might be wrong. The colours of the flower are wonderful against the rich green background but they are placed too central in the frame. I would suggest using rule of thirds to position the flowers.', '2007-03-18 11:19:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469840, 482712, 72714, '<td valign="top">Awesome! Awesome! Awesome! I love this photograph. It is normally quite difficult to get the exposure for this type of shot spot on, but IMO you have managed to do just that. There is detail in the foreground and the pillars are not overexposed either. The grain adds great detail to this shot and I love the way both the pillars and the lights are leading the figure in the direction of the square at the end.</td>', 'Awesome! Awesome! Awesome! I love this photograph. It is normally quite difficult to get the exposure for this type of shot spot on, but IMO you have managed to do just that. There is detail in the foreground and the pillars are not overexposed either. The grain adds great detail to this shot and I love the way both the pillars and the lights are leading the figure in the direction of the square at the end.', '2007-03-18 11:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469866, 481533, 21124, '<td valign="top">That is quite an unusual composition. It''s not bad, but would perhaps works better without the background trees, keeping only the 3 important ones. (of course, without beeing in situ, I don''t know if it would have been doable)</td>', 'That is quite an unusual composition. It''s not bad, but would perhaps works better without the background trees, keeping only the 3 important ones. (of course, without beeing in situ, I don''t know if it would have been doable)', '2007-03-18 11:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469870, 483320, 21124, '<td valign="top">This grain seems at bit too much artificial</td>', 'This grain seems at bit too much artificial', '2007-03-18 11:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469934, 483610, 71138, '<td valign="top">i like the title</td>', 'i like the title', '2007-03-18 12:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469943, 483809, 21124, '<td valign="top">Too close, in my opinion</td>', 'Too close, in my opinion', '2007-03-18 12:50:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469944, 483847, 66201, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of the Ted Hughes poem "The Horses" - could be the illustration for it. Striking image.</td>', 'Reminds me of the Ted Hughes poem "The Horses" - could be the illustration for it. Striking image.', '2007-03-18 12:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469945, 481897, 66201, '<td valign="top">Very retro. Striking.</td>', 'Very retro. Striking.', '2007-03-18 12:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469946, 482482, 66201, '<td valign="top">love the selective desat. That and the grain work beautifully for this image.</td>', 'love the selective desat. That and the grain work beautifully for this image.', '2007-03-18 12:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469951, 483688, 66201, '<td valign="top">Ah - Fairview Estate. Where are the goats? I was just there yesterday - then went on to Zevernwacht Estate! The grain works nicely in this.</td>', 'Ah - Fairview Estate. Where are the goats? I was just there yesterday - then went on to Zevernwacht Estate! The grain works nicely in this.', '2007-03-18 12:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469952, 481657, 66201, '<td valign="top">Stunning</td>', 'Stunning', '2007-03-18 12:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469953, 480763, 30982, '<td valign="top">Good way to include grain with your grain!</td>', 'Good way to include grain with your grain!', '2007-03-18 12:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469956, 481616, 21124, '<td valign="top">A bit too dark...</td>', 'A bit too dark...', '2007-03-18 12:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469957, 483299, 71138, '<td valign="top">it is abit dark for me</td>', 'it is abit dark for me', '2007-03-18 12:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469959, 482514, 66201, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love the divide - almost works as a diptych image. The old man is oblivious of the young couple just on the other side of the fence...so many opposites: old, young, single, couple, up, down, garden, street, silence, conversation, order, tension...</td>', 'I absolutely love the divide - almost works as a diptych image. The old man is oblivious of the young couple just on the other side of the fence...so many opposites: old, young, single, couple, up, down, garden, street, silence, conversation, order, tension...', '2007-03-18 12:56:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469962, 483885, 21124, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective: "walls" seem to be quite high, while they aren''t probably that high in reality</td>', 'Interesting perspective: "walls" seem to be quite high, while they aren''t probably that high in reality', '2007-03-18 13:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469964, 483764, 21124, '<td valign="top">The angle brings action, nice</td>', 'The angle brings action, nice', '2007-03-18 13:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469968, 483843, 21124, '<td valign="top">I don''t really like the color noise, a monochromatic noise would probably be better.</td>', 'I don''t really like the color noise, a monochromatic noise would probably be better.', '2007-03-18 13:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469969, 483518, 21124, '<td valign="top">Good pic, nice subject, good use of selective desaturation. But the frame...</td>', 'Good pic, nice subject, good use of selective desaturation. But the frame...', '2007-03-18 13:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469975, 483390, 66384, '<td valign="top">Really don''t see much grain here -- a little in the shadows.</td>', 'Really don''t see much grain here -- a little in the shadows.', '2007-03-18 13:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469976, 483898, 66384, '<td valign="top">Lovely photo, but the grain doesn''t seem to improve it.</td>', 'Lovely photo, but the grain doesn''t seem to improve it.', '2007-03-18 13:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469980, 482186, 66384, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition and I think the grain creates a subdued mood.</td>', 'Very nice composition and I think the grain creates a subdued mood.', '2007-03-18 13:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469985, 483984, 66384, '<td valign="top">Don''t think the grain improves this still life. It makes the fruit look unappetizing. I would like the composition better if the pomegranate(?) wasn''t covering the blue bottle. I think the bottle is the most interesting thing in the shot and the blue tones of the wall complement it nicely.</td>', 'Don''t think the grain improves this still life. It makes the fruit look unappetizing. I would like the composition better if the pomegranate(?) wasn''t covering the blue bottle. I think the bottle is the most interesting thing in the shot and the blue tones of the wall complement it nicely.', '2007-03-18 13:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469989, 481434, 71138, '<td valign="top">this is one mad image</td>', 'this is one mad image', '2007-03-18 13:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469992, 482642, 54778, '<td valign="top">nice shot.. perhaps slightly over exposed and not enough contrast..</td>', 'nice shot.. perhaps slightly over exposed and not enough contrast..', '2007-03-18 13:22:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3469993, 481510, 66384, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and fantasy. The grain definitely helps the effect. It is a little too dark on my monitor, I''d like to see the forest a little more clearly because it looks very interesting.</td>', 'Nice composition and fantasy. The grain definitely helps the effect. It is a little too dark on my monitor, I''d like to see the forest a little more clearly because it looks very interesting.', '2007-03-18 13:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3470000, 483520, 66384, '<td valign="top">Don''t think the grain improves this image and the whole thing appears washed out. I think it needs a little more contrast.</td>', 'Don''t think the grain improves this image and the whole thing appears washed out. I think it needs a little more contrast.', '2007-03-18 13:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3470001, 483634, 66384, '<td valign="top">The grain gives this a foggy look that creates a nice mood. Very nice.</td>', 'The grain gives this a foggy look that creates a nice mood. Very nice.', '2007-03-18 13:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3470002, 480746, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very emotive - good use of grain, twice.</td>', 'Very emotive - good use of grain, twice.', '2007-03-18 13:28:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3470003, 481723, 30982, '<td valign="top">The sheer joy of this is wonderful.</td>', 'The sheer joy of this is wonderful.', '2007-03-18 13:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3470004, 483012, 30982, '<td valign="top">I love the musical grace of this!</td>', 'I love the musical grace of this!', '2007-03-18 13:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3470005, 483814, 71138, '<td valign="top">1938? this image was not taken within the sites rules ;) joke i like this image 7</td>', '1938? this image was not taken within the sites rules ;) joke i like this image 7', '2007-03-18 13:29:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3470006, 483540, 30982, '<td valign="top">Composition is excellent as is the editing.</td>', 'Composition is excellent as is the editing.', '2007-03-18 13:29:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3470008, 483589, 66384, '<td valign="top">Don''t know what you''re trying to do here. It looks washed out, and the grain doesn''t seem to improve it. I would prefer to see the ring turned straight too. Perhaps the shape or color of that would mimic the eyes, and give the composition a little more interest.</td>', 'Don''t know what you''re trying to do here. It looks washed out, and the grain doesn''t seem to improve it. I would prefer to see the ring turned straight too. Perhaps the shape or color of that would mimic the eyes, and give the composition a little more interest.', '2007-03-18 13:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3470009, 483562, 30982, '<td valign="top">Perfect composition and the toning is excellent.  Can''t see this done without the subtle grain!</td>', 'Perfect composition and the toning is excellent.  Can''t see this done without the subtle grain!', '2007-03-18 13:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3470010, 483762, 30982, '<td valign="top">Magical and bittersweet - great contrast.</td>', 'Magical and bittersweet - great contrast.', '2007-03-18 13:31:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3470011, 483662, 30982, '<td valign="top">If this isn''t Robert''s work, it''s worth of being his.  Exceptional light, beautiful use of grain.  Elegance defined.</td>', 'If this isn''t Robert''s work, it''s worth of being his.  Exceptional light, beautiful use of grain.  Elegance defined.', '2007-03-18 13:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3470012, 483412, 30982, '<td valign="top">Those eyes.  They just tear into your heart!</td>', 'Those eyes.  They just tear into your heart!', '2007-03-18 13:32:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3470013, 483735, 66384, '<td valign="top">Nice bokeh, and the grain I think the grain adds interest and mood to this shot.</td>', 'Nice bokeh, and the grain I think the grain adds interest and mood to this shot.', '2007-03-18 13:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3470014, 483821, 30982, '<td valign="top">How wonderfully touching and sweet!</td>', 'How wonderfully touching and sweet!', '2007-03-18 13:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3470015, 482990, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is just perfect.</td>', 'This is just perfect.', '2007-03-18 13:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3470016, 483147, 30982, '<td valign="top">Timeless, perfectly exposed, perfectly executed.</td>', 'Timeless, perfectly exposed, perfectly executed.', '2007-03-18 13:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3470017, 483727, 66384, '<td valign="top">Nice. The grain seems to echo the texture of the neck. I like the sepia tone.</td>', 'Nice. The grain seems to echo the texture of the neck. I like the sepia tone.', '2007-03-18 13:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3470019, 482990, 66384, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, and you captured a nice moment. I think the grain hurts rather than helps this image.</td>', 'Nice composition, and you captured a nice moment. I think the grain hurts rather than helps this image.', '2007-03-18 13:35:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3470020, 483082, 56494, '<td valign="top">maybe wouldve worked better in black and white?</td>', 'maybe wouldve worked better in black and white?', '2007-03-18 13:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3470021, 481773, 66384, '<td valign="top">Don''t see how the grain improves this image.</td>', 'Don''t see how the grain improves this image.', '2007-03-18 13:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3470022, 483875, 66384, '<td valign="top">Looks very old fashion. Very nice composition and light. 8</td>', 'Looks very old fashion. Very nice composition and light. 8', '2007-03-18 13:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3470023, 483567, 56494, '<td valign="top">i think there''s abit too much grain on this, also the grain isn''t working for this shot. Just my opinion... that''s all.</td>', 'i think there''s abit too much grain on this, also the grain isn''t working for this shot. Just my opinion... that''s all.', '2007-03-18 13:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3470025, 482886, 56494, '<td valign="top">oh, what time does to you...</td>', 'oh, what time does to you...', '2007-03-18 13:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3470026, 483787, 56494, '<td valign="top">that''s gotta hurt</td>', 'that''s gotta hurt', '2007-03-18 13:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3470027, 482376, 21124, '<td valign="top">Good use of negative space</td>', 'Good use of negative space', '2007-03-18 13:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3470028, 483643, 66384, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot. I think I''d like it better without the grain.</td>', 'Wonderful shot. I think I''d like it better without the grain.', '2007-03-18 13:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3470029, 483770, 56494, '<td valign="top">oh my! it looks like the corpse of Abe! too funny!</td>', 'oh my! it looks like the corpse of Abe! too funny!', '2007-03-18 13:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3470031, 483723, 21124, '<td valign="top">Nice one, but unfortunately it seems that there is a strong compression pattern.</td>', 'Nice one, but unfortunately it seems that there is a strong compression pattern.', '2007-03-18 13:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
