(3470059, 483753, 66384, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t seem to be much grain/noise here. The toad has a naturally grainy look to its skin, but I don''t think that''s the point of the challenge.</td>', 'Doesn''t seem to be much grain/noise here. The toad has a naturally grainy look to its skin, but I don''t think that''s the point of the challenge.', '2007-03-18 14:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
