(3470064, 483235, 66384, '<td valign="top">Not sure the grain does much for this image, but I like the interesting perspective/composition.</td>', 'Not sure the grain does much for this image, but I like the interesting perspective/composition.', '2007-03-18 14:12:20.000000', NULL, 1),
