(3470074, 483829, 66384, '<td valign="top">Yikes, this is why I am still (at age 65) uncomfortable hanging my feet over the bed. Very nice capture of that boogie-man, scared of the dark, feeling! The grain definitely adds to the illusion. 10</td>', 'Yikes, this is why I am still (at age 65) uncomfortable hanging my feet over the bed. Very nice capture of that boogie-man, scared of the dark, feeling! The grain definitely adds to the illusion. 10', '2007-03-18 14:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
