(3470078, 483594, 66384, '<td valign="top">The grain is so heavy it looks like a sand painting. Nice effect.</td>', 'The grain is so heavy it looks like a sand painting. Nice effect.', '2007-03-18 14:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
