(3470081, 482326, 50289, '<td valign="top">I don''t usually like tilted shots (I''ve tried them a few times and gotten negative comments) but it works here.  I really like the dark, moody feel of this picture.  It''s almost dream like.</td>', 'I don''t usually like tilted shots (I''ve tried them a few times and gotten negative comments) but it works here.  I really like the dark, moody feel of this picture.  It''s almost dream like.', '2007-03-18 14:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
