(3470098, 483842, 50289, '<td valign="top">I''m not a big flower nut but this is well done.  In a regular entry I don''t think I would have voted as high as I did here.  I think the grain adds a lot to the delicate look of the flower.  This is one of my top pics.</td>', 'I''m not a big flower nut but this is well done.  In a regular entry I don''t think I would have voted as high as I did here.  I think the grain adds a lot to the delicate look of the flower.  This is one of my top pics.', '2007-03-18 14:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
