(3470771, 481616, 74953, '<td valign="top">Too dark...</td>', 'Too dark...', '2007-03-18 23:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3470775, 482264, 74953, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting</td>', 'Nice lighting', '2007-03-18 23:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3470786, 482476, 69102, '<td valign="top">The noise in this looks very artificial and for me doesn''t add to the image. Like the setup, composition, and tones however. - 6</td>', 'The noise in this looks very artificial and for me doesn''t add to the image. Like the setup, composition, and tones however. - 6', '2007-03-18 23:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3470794, 483814, 69102, '<td valign="top">Not sure if this is on that the general DPC set is going to like, but I really dig this one. The high contrast and subtle graining really give this a rugged and erie tone. - 8</td>', 'Not sure if this is on that the general DPC set is going to like, but I really dig this one. The high contrast and subtle graining really give this a rugged and erie tone. - 8', '2007-03-18 23:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3470796, 480747, 61379, '<td valign="top">PERFECT 10!</td>', 'PERFECT 10!', '2007-03-18 23:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3470803, 483233, 69102, '<td valign="top">This photograph needs a lot of work. I can see how the visual pun idea might appeal, but the composition just looks plunked down on a wrinkled sheet with no real balance or interesting visuals. The grain doesn''t enhance the image, but just makes it look low quality. I can image a version of this in black and white, shot from a low angle rather than from above, with angled or overhead lighting to give the shot some depth and atmospherics. Maybe just the gun, a single bullet, and the glasses.</td>', 'This photograph needs a lot of work. I can see how the visual pun idea might appeal, but the composition just looks plunked down on a wrinkled sheet with no real balance or interesting visuals. The grain doesn''t enhance the image, but just makes it look low quality. I can image a version of this in black and white, shot from a low angle rather than from above, with angled or overhead lighting to give the shot some depth and atmospherics. Maybe just the gun, a single bullet, and the glasses.', '2007-03-18 23:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3470807, 483902, 69102, '<td valign="top">As an old-school film shooter, this image really doesn''t look grainy at all, but I can see how someone used to digital, noise-reduced images might find this "grainy." Tones and textures are wonderful. The center of the flower might be better compositionally a little higher or lower in the frame, but still pushed off center horizontally as you have done. - 7</td>', 'As an old-school film shooter, this image really doesn''t look grainy at all, but I can see how someone used to digital, noise-reduced images might find this "grainy." Tones and textures are wonderful. The center of the flower might be better compositionally a little higher or lower in the frame, but still pushed off center horizontally as you have done. - 7', '2007-03-18 23:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3470812, 483762, 69102, '<td valign="top">Great image. Love the tension between the standing, but ultimately just as empty, dress behind the glass and the apparently discarded dress in the foreground. Graining used very well. - 10</td>', 'Great image. Love the tension between the standing, but ultimately just as empty, dress behind the glass and the apparently discarded dress in the foreground. Graining used very well. - 10', '2007-03-18 23:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3470814, 484013, 69102, '<td valign="top">Like the toning and the subtle grain. Very desolate. Good "winter" shot. - 7</td>', 'Like the toning and the subtle grain. Very desolate. Good "winter" shot. - 7', '2007-03-18 23:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3470815, 482030, 69102, '<td valign="top">Very nice, dynamic shot. Graining adds to the feel of motion and the isolation of the subject. Well done - 10.</td>', 'Very nice, dynamic shot. Graining adds to the feel of motion and the isolation of the subject. Well done - 10.', '2007-03-18 23:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3470817, 481149, 69102, '<td valign="top">A wonderful portrait with an excellent use of grain. The textures of the light and grain the background is particularly pleasing, and the blown out highlights in the hair and on the shoulder are very effective. - 10</td>', 'A wonderful portrait with an excellent use of grain. The textures of the light and grain the background is particularly pleasing, and the blown out highlights in the hair and on the shoulder are very effective. - 10', '2007-03-18 23:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3470820, 483010, 69102, '<td valign="top">There is so much wonderful stuff going on this shot! Lighting, grain and toning are all perfect and provide the perfect mood to suit the title and subject. Very erie. - 9</td>', 'There is so much wonderful stuff going on this shot! Lighting, grain and toning are all perfect and provide the perfect mood to suit the title and subject. Very erie. - 9', '2007-03-18 23:33:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3470828, 483394, 69102, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot. Don''t generally like these "looking down the barrel of a gun" images, but this one just makes me realize that the others I''ve seen just weren''t done very well. Focus and shallow DOF make the shot very dramatic and give the impression of being brought up short. Graining done well and adds to the overall effect. The shot has a cinematic feel to it. - 9</td>', 'Very cool shot. Don''t generally like these "looking down the barrel of a gun" images, but this one just makes me realize that the others I''ve seen just weren''t done very well. Focus and shallow DOF make the shot very dramatic and give the impression of being brought up short. Graining done well and adds to the overall effect. The shot has a cinematic feel to it. - 9', '2007-03-18 23:36:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3470829, 483927, 74953, '<td valign="top">poor subject</td>', 'poor subject', '2007-03-18 23:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3470834, 483249, 74953, '<td valign="top">a little grain heavy</td>', 'a little grain heavy', '2007-03-18 23:37:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3470836, 482030, 74953, '<td valign="top">a little on the dark side.</td>', 'a little on the dark side.', '2007-03-18 23:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3470841, 482883, 74953, '<td valign="top">would have been better with out all the stuff at the top of the image.</td>', 'would have been better with out all the stuff at the top of the image.', '2007-03-18 23:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3470847, 481888, 69102, '<td valign="top">A fun candid. The grain works well here. This looks very 60s/70s. - 8</td>', 'A fun candid. The grain works well here. This looks very 60s/70s. - 8', '2007-03-18 23:40:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3470848, 484014, 69102, '<td valign="top">Really like this one, even though the graining is so subtle. (As an old film shooter, I would consider this to be a practically grainless image.) Scoring at a 9, but would probably have bumped to a 10 if there had been more detail in the man''s face. - 9</td>', 'Really like this one, even though the graining is so subtle. (As an old film shooter, I would consider this to be a practically grainless image.) Scoring at a 9, but would probably have bumped to a 10 if there had been more detail in the man''s face. - 9', '2007-03-18 23:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3470849, 481352, 69102, '<td valign="top">Great street image. The older woman, the young woman in the add, and the faceless sillouette in the window (photographer?) create a very good sense of drama, anticipation, and mystery. - 9</td>', 'Great street image. The older woman, the young woman in the add, and the faceless sillouette in the window (photographer?) create a very good sense of drama, anticipation, and mystery. - 9', '2007-03-18 23:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3470850, 480746, 69102, '<td valign="top">A great "classic" image. - 9</td>', 'A great "classic" image. - 9', '2007-03-18 23:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3470851, 483839, 69102, '<td valign="top">Definitely a dreamy image. Grain and toning work very well here. Focus and shallow DOF also work quite well. - 9</td>', 'Definitely a dreamy image. Grain and toning work very well here. Focus and shallow DOF also work quite well. - 9', '2007-03-18 23:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3470852, 483907, 74953, '<td valign="top">Nice shot</td>', 'Nice shot', '2007-03-18 23:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3470856, 480747, 69102, '<td valign="top">Okay... whoah! This is an absolutely brilliant image. Please tell me that the snow is real and not an added effect. Coming back to bump this up now that the image has been validated. You have a great eye. Graining is subtle, but effective and enhances the mood. - 10</td>', 'Okay... whoah! This is an absolutely brilliant image. Please tell me that the snow is real and not an added effect. Coming back to bump this up now that the image has been validated. You have a great eye. Graining is subtle, but effective and enhances the mood. - 10', '2007-03-18 23:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3470859, 483594, 74953, '<td valign="top">too much grain for me</td>', 'too much grain for me', '2007-03-18 23:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3470861, 483953, 69102, '<td valign="top">The use of the negative here doesn''t add anything photographically for me, and if it was meant to convey meaning metaphorically the meaning is not clear.</td>', 'The use of the negative here doesn''t add anything photographically for me, and if it was meant to convey meaning metaphorically the meaning is not clear.', '2007-03-18 23:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3470869, 481279, 74953, '<td valign="top">Nicely done</td>', 'Nicely done', '2007-03-18 23:47:17.000000', NULL, 1);
