(3471515, 483568, 34192, '<td valign="top">The grain doesn''t really enhance this image.  Ideally, one would look for a subject to work with the grain.  Good colors but the composition is weak.</td>', 'The grain doesn''t really enhance this image.  Ideally, one would look for a subject to work with the grain.  Good colors but the composition is weak.', '2007-03-19 06:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3471516, 483125, 34192, '<td valign="top">I like contrasty pictures but I can''t find a subject here.</td>', 'I like contrasty pictures but I can''t find a subject here.', '2007-03-19 06:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3471523, 483797, 67145, '<td valign="top">an unusual and interesting subject to give a grainy texture .. i love how it almost looks like an old painting .. great composition ...</td>', 'an unusual and interesting subject to give a grainy texture .. i love how it almost looks like an old painting .. great composition ...', '2007-03-19 06:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3471525, 483179, 67145, '<td valign="top">wow ..  wot an excellent image ... that amazing sky with the shell of a building ... OMG the combination is awesome ...</td>', 'wow ..  wot an excellent image ... that amazing sky with the shell of a building ... OMG the combination is awesome ...', '2007-03-19 06:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3471526, 483616, 34192, '<td valign="top">I like the processing here but the image otherwise isn''t very interesting.</td>', 'I like the processing here but the image otherwise isn''t very interesting.', '2007-03-19 06:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3471530, 483266, 67145, '<td valign="top">this is awesome ... the grain works sooooooo perfectly with this image ..  a wonderful old world feeling with the grain, the clothing and the ''props'' ..</td>', 'this is awesome ... the grain works sooooooo perfectly with this image ..  a wonderful old world feeling with the grain, the clothing and the ''props'' ..', '2007-03-19 06:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3471531, 481374, 34192, '<td valign="top">I like all the textures here and the processing and grain work with the image.  I''m just not sure of the why.</td>', 'I like all the textures here and the processing and grain work with the image.  I''m just not sure of the why.', '2007-03-19 06:36:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3471535, 481533, 34192, '<td valign="top">I think the composition works for what you have.  The ends of the side trees really help to hold my eyes in the image and on the central tree.  But on the whole, the image lacks tension.  I''m left thinking, why was this taken?  What is the photographer trying to show me?</td>', 'I think the composition works for what you have.  The ends of the side trees really help to hold my eyes in the image and on the central tree.  But on the whole, the image lacks tension.  I''m left thinking, why was this taken?  What is the photographer trying to show me?', '2007-03-19 06:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3471539, 483070, 67145, '<td valign="top">omg omg .... just excellent ..  a great portrayal of possibly despair or something equally as gut wrenching, with your combination of the background pic and the posture  .... excellent title ..</td>', 'omg omg .... just excellent ..  a great portrayal of possibly despair or something equally as gut wrenching, with your combination of the background pic and the posture  .... excellent title ..', '2007-03-19 06:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3471545, 483988, 67145, '<td valign="top">why hello !!! ... great composition, the grainy texture works so well for this image .. title fits real well !.. :)</td>', 'why hello !!! ... great composition, the grainy texture works so well for this image .. title fits real well !.. :)', '2007-03-19 06:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3471551, 483562, 67145, '<td valign="top"><b>WOW ...</b> excellent  ... i love your composition .. love your choice of colours .. and the textures on the pelican and that foreground pole he''s sitting on are absolutely amazing ... it like he''s become a part of it ..... just love this photograph and your editing .........</td>', 'WOW ... excellent  ... i love your composition .. love your choice of colours .. and the textures on the pelican and that foreground pole he''s sitting on are absolutely amazing ... it like he''s become a part of it ..... just love this photograph and your editing .........', '2007-03-19 06:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3471555, 481893, 67145, '<td valign="top">absolutely gorgeous photograph ... beautiful child, beautiful expression, excellent crop and great in b&amp;w .. those eye''s are amazing ..</td>', 'absolutely gorgeous photograph ... beautiful child, beautiful expression, excellent crop and great in b&w .. those eye''s are amazing ..', '2007-03-19 06:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
