(3474079, 483668, 66597, '<td valign="top">This is a very sharp image - not seeing the grain here. If the preying mantis were in a closer crop, this would be an awesome photo - just maybe not for this challenge.</td>', 'This is a very sharp image - not seeing the grain here. If the preying mantis were in a closer crop, this would be an awesome photo - just maybe not for this challenge.', '2007-03-19 21:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3474080, 481616, 66597, '<td valign="top">This looks like it might be a very interesting photo with just a bit more light. Unfortunately, I''m unable to see any detail. The red tone is nice - would just like to see more of it.</td>', 'This looks like it might be a very interesting photo with just a bit more light. Unfortunately, I''m unable to see any detail. The red tone is nice - would just like to see more of it.', '2007-03-19 21:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3474082, 483031, 72833, '<td valign="top">this is a beautiful sunset. very nice landscape shot. good job.</td>', 'this is a beautiful sunset. very nice landscape shot. good job.', '2007-03-19 21:37:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3474084, 483390, 66597, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, I like the Korean writing mixed with English on the barrells, and I like the whole industrial scene. Now to the not-so-good part. This looks like it was photographed with high direct sun. Thus, you''ve got a lot of flat light and shadows that aren''t so flattering to the subject. And although you achieved nearly a whole spectrum of grays betwen pure white and pure black, the wide swath of gray in the front make the whole photo take on a gray cast. I''d consider re-shooting this in early morning or late evening for I imagine much more pleasing results. I certainly don''t mean to be harsh here - just want to give whatever insight (and feel free to ignore!) that might help a little.</td>', 'I like the idea, I like the Korean writing mixed with English on the barrells, and I like the whole industrial scene. Now to the not-so-good part. This looks like it was photographed with high direct sun. Thus, you''ve got a lot of flat light and shadows that aren''t so flattering to the subject. And although you achieved nearly a whole spectrum of grays betwen pure white and pure black, the wide swath of gray in the front make the whole photo take on a gray cast. I''d consider re-shooting this in early morning or late evening for I imagine much more pleasing results. I certainly don''t mean to be harsh here - just want to give whatever insight (and feel free to ignore!) that might help a little.', '2007-03-19 21:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3474086, 482878, 72833, '<td valign="top">breath-taking! i like the mountains and pines. well done.</td>', 'breath-taking! i like the mountains and pines. well done.', '2007-03-19 21:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3474088, 484025, 66597, '<td valign="top">Although there is grain here, I''m not sure it enhances the photo - I get more of a sense of adding grain for grain''s sake then choosing a subject that grain would really enhance and playing on it. It may also be due to color temperature - this looks like an "open shade" situation where the light was not adjusted, so the result is rather flat with a lot of grays. Finally, I think there may just be too many existing textures to really support the extra texture of grain. There''s just an awful lot going on in this small space, and it is difficult to focus on the subject (which I''m guessing is the bridge). The good news - you have and idea for putting a composition together. This bridge with different lighting, color temp and DOF could be very interesting indeed.</td>', 'Although there is grain here, I''m not sure it enhances the photo - I get more of a sense of adding grain for grain''s sake then choosing a subject that grain would really enhance and playing on it. It may also be due to color temperature - this looks like an "open shade" situation where the light was not adjusted, so the result is rather flat with a lot of grays. Finally, I think there may just be too many existing textures to really support the extra texture of grain. There''s just an awful lot going on in this small space, and it is difficult to focus on the subject (which I''m guessing is the bridge). The good news - you have and idea for putting a composition together. This bridge with different lighting, color temp and DOF could be very interesting indeed.', '2007-03-19 21:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3474090, 483908, 66597, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely photo with nice leading lines, but unfortunately I''m not seeing much grain at all here.</td>', 'This is a lovely photo with nice leading lines, but unfortunately I''m not seeing much grain at all here.', '2007-03-19 21:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3474091, 483882, 66597, '<td valign="top">Although I like the sullen / almost defiant expression, it is difficult for me to learn more as my eyes wander around this photo. First, the lighting is harsh and direct, so her face looks a little flattened and cold. Second there''s no sense of context I can glean - like is she wearing a uniform? Religious jewelry? What is her setting? Has she been abused? I find myself wantint a little more information from the artist before I''m willing to be drawn in. With that hair, her strong feautures and icy gazy, she could tell a whole story with just one glance - but that glance as to occur in a meaningful setting for teh viewer to be able to relate to her situation.</td>', 'Although I like the sullen / almost defiant expression, it is difficult for me to learn more as my eyes wander around this photo. First, the lighting is harsh and direct, so her face looks a little flattened and cold. Second there''s no sense of context I can glean - like is she wearing a uniform? Religious jewelry? What is her setting? Has she been abused? I find myself wantint a little more information from the artist before I''m willing to be drawn in. With that hair, her strong feautures and icy gazy, she could tell a whole story with just one glance - but that glance as to occur in a meaningful setting for teh viewer to be able to relate to her situation.', '2007-03-19 21:38:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3474092, 482058, 66597, '<td valign="top">This fits the challenge fine. The rock is certainly grainy, and the title carries the photo fairly well. However, I''m not sure it hold enough interest to make me want to learn more or to associate it with a story. Without an emotional element that speaks to me, I am forced to make a score decision based on technicals. The technicals seem okay, though a little flat. The full range of b/w tones aren''t present, which knocks it down a little. The composition is neither strong nor weak. Not terrible, by any means, just not awe-inspiring for me (and please keep in mind, that is only me. Others may be blown away).</td>', 'This fits the challenge fine. The rock is certainly grainy, and the title carries the photo fairly well. However, I''m not sure it hold enough interest to make me want to learn more or to associate it with a story. Without an emotional element that speaks to me, I am forced to make a score decision based on technicals. The technicals seem okay, though a little flat. The full range of b/w tones aren''t present, which knocks it down a little. The composition is neither strong nor weak. Not terrible, by any means, just not awe-inspiring for me (and please keep in mind, that is only me. Others may be blown away).', '2007-03-19 21:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3474093, 481180, 72833, '<td valign="top">cool photograph. i love the hue .. it adds a lot more interest to the snow and to the sky. overall, i really like what you did with this image. nice composition too!</td>', 'cool photograph. i love the hue .. it adds a lot more interest to the snow and to the sky. overall, i really like what you did with this image. nice composition too!', '2007-03-19 21:39:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3474101, 483986, 66597, '<td valign="top">This is one of the stronger entries in this challenge IMO. I think the grain suits the subject well, and the sepia toning gives the feeling of an old postcard. Very well done!</td>', 'This is one of the stronger entries in this challenge IMO. I think the grain suits the subject well, and the sepia toning gives the feeling of an old postcard. Very well done!', '2007-03-19 21:40:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3474102, 483853, 66597, '<td valign="top">Very cool. Almost looks like a combo of HDR and grain (realize you can''t do HDR in basic). Great effect!</td>', 'Very cool. Almost looks like a combo of HDR and grain (realize you can''t do HDR in basic). Great effect!', '2007-03-19 21:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3474103, 481687, 66597, '<td valign="top">One of my faves in challenge. So simple, yet so effective.</td>', 'One of my faves in challenge. So simple, yet so effective.', '2007-03-19 21:40:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3474105, 483930, 66597, '<td valign="top">I really like the simplicity and small relative scale of the lighthouse here. I think the grain is quite effective in this photo.</td>', 'I really like the simplicity and small relative scale of the lighthouse here. I think the grain is quite effective in this photo.', '2007-03-19 21:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3474106, 483169, 66597, '<td valign="top">I think this is an exceedingly artistic photo. Love the simplicity. I can honestly see this one hanging in a gallery or even MOMA.</td>', 'I think this is an exceedingly artistic photo. Love the simplicity. I can honestly see this one hanging in a gallery or even MOMA.', '2007-03-19 21:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3474107, 483317, 66597, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Bumping from 7 to 8. The motion in the scarf really makes this special.</td>', 'Beautiful. Bumping from 7 to 8. The motion in the scarf really makes this special.', '2007-03-19 21:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3474108, 483394, 66597, '<td valign="top">This one certainly grabs attention. It is very well done.</td>', 'This one certainly grabs attention. It is very well done.', '2007-03-19 21:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3474109, 483847, 66597, '<td valign="top">Bumping from 7 to 8. Interesting optical illusion with the horse - keep double-checking to make sure it isn''t real.</td>', 'Bumping from 7 to 8. Interesting optical illusion with the horse - keep double-checking to make sure it isn''t real.', '2007-03-19 21:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3474110, 483837, 66597, '<td valign="top">Chess photos are difficult to take effectively so that they grab the attention of non chess players. I think you succeeded very well here. The grain is effective in this situation.</td>', 'Chess photos are difficult to take effectively so that they grab the attention of non chess players. I think you succeeded very well here. The grain is effective in this situation.', '2007-03-19 21:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3474111, 483301, 66597, '<td valign="top">Fabulous composition and lighting.</td>', 'Fabulous composition and lighting.', '2007-03-19 21:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3474112, 482326, 66597, '<td valign="top">Angle is very effective. Well done!</td>', 'Angle is very effective. Well done!', '2007-03-19 21:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3474114, 481893, 66597, '<td valign="top">The freckles and exposure lend themselves very well to the grain. Nicely done!</td>', 'The freckles and exposure lend themselves very well to the grain. Nicely done!', '2007-03-19 21:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3474116, 483540, 66597, '<td valign="top">I really love the scale and perspective here. Very well done.</td>', 'I really love the scale and perspective here. Very well done.', '2007-03-19 21:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3474118, 483037, 66597, '<td valign="top">One of the more effective uses of grain in this challenge - it really works very well here. Nicely done!</td>', 'One of the more effective uses of grain in this challenge - it really works very well here. Nicely done!', '2007-03-19 21:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3474120, 482376, 66597, '<td valign="top">Very poignant - the scale and small area of grain vs. white space is nicely done here.</td>', 'Very poignant - the scale and small area of grain vs. white space is nicely done here.', '2007-03-19 21:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3474122, 482173, 66597, '<td valign="top">I''ve never seen a ski area look spooky before, but you definitely pulled it off. Very interesting shot, like the ultra-blue effect here.</td>', 'I''ve never seen a ski area look spooky before, but you definitely pulled it off. Very interesting shot, like the ultra-blue effect here.', '2007-03-19 21:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3474123, 482712, 66597, '<td valign="top">Interesting stance - almost looks like your model is challenging the road ahead. The lighting is very effective here.</td>', 'Interesting stance - almost looks like your model is challenging the road ahead. The lighting is very effective here.', '2007-03-19 21:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3474124, 482198, 66597, '<td valign="top">Very interesting angle / perspective. Makes an ordinary shot into something extraordinary. Well done.</td>', 'Very interesting angle / perspective. Makes an ordinary shot into something extraordinary. Well done.', '2007-03-19 21:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3474125, 483727, 66597, '<td valign="top">I love this - you really did capture the essence of his long neck here :-)</td>', 'I love this - you really did capture the essence of his long neck here :-)', '2007-03-19 21:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3474126, 482177, 66597, '<td valign="top">Nice almost HDR look here. The color grain really works on this. Great entry!</td>', 'Nice almost HDR look here. The color grain really works on this. Great entry!', '2007-03-19 21:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3474127, 481878, 66597, '<td valign="top">This is a great entry, really captures desolation. Maybe it is just my eyes, but the horizon looks skewed to the left?</td>', 'This is a great entry, really captures desolation. Maybe it is just my eyes, but the horizon looks skewed to the left?', '2007-03-19 21:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3474129, 482380, 45341, '<td valign="top">that is really cute... i want one...</td>', 'that is really cute... i want one...', '2007-03-19 21:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3474319, 482030, 71914, '<td valign="top">Very artistic, moody.</td>', 'Very artistic, moody.', '2007-03-19 23:15:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3474362, 483412, 71914, '<td valign="top">please tell me this was staged and that she is yours! nice pic.</td>', 'please tell me this was staged and that she is yours! nice pic.', '2007-03-19 23:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
