(3476242, 483147, 66515, '<td valign="top">This has a great old time movie feel to it. The man almost looks like Dean Martin or Jerry Lewis. The expression on the people''s faces really makes this shot great. <br/> <br/>The black and white conversion is quite suitable for this picture. <br/> <br/>The shallow DOF works well as it appears that the background would have been distracting had it been sharp at all. <br/> <br/>Challenge: The level of noise is good here. A lot (including my own sadly) went over board with the noise. This is the perfect level. Enough to give it an "old feel" to it but not so much that it diminishes the quality of the image.</td>', 'This has a great old time movie feel to it. The man almost looks like Dean Martin or Jerry Lewis. The expression on the people''s faces really makes this shot great.  The black and white conversion is quite suitable for this picture.  The shallow DOF works well as it appears that the background would have been distracting had it been sharp at all.  Challenge: The level of noise is good here. A lot (including my own sadly) went over board with the noise. This is the perfect level. Enough to give it an "old feel" to it but not so much that it diminishes the quality of the image.', '2007-03-20 20:32:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3476243, 483914, 75803, '<td valign="top">I love this photo!!! It has to be the best one on this whole website!<br/>YOU ROCK!</td>', 'I love this photo!!! It has to be the best one on this whole website!YOU ROCK!', '2007-03-20 20:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3476244, 482326, 66515, '<td valign="top">Composition: Very dramatic. I normally don''t like tilted shots but it really works here and creates interesting lines. There are a lot of interesting shapes to look at (LOTs of triangles). The bowsprit takes the eye nicely across the frame without being overpowering. <br/> <br/>General comments:<br/>The sky is superb. The noise give it an ominous feeling while still retaining a good level of detail.  <br/> <br/>The Challenge: Nice level of noise. Enough to give it the shot an ominous mood and an "old" feeling. Not so much that it distracts or takes away some of the finer details.</td>', 'Composition: Very dramatic. I normally don''t like tilted shots but it really works here and creates interesting lines. There are a lot of interesting shapes to look at (LOTs of triangles). The bowsprit takes the eye nicely across the frame without being overpowering.  General comments:The sky is superb. The noise give it an ominous feeling while still retaining a good level of detail.   The Challenge: Nice level of noise. Enough to give it the shot an ominous mood and an "old" feeling. Not so much that it distracts or takes away some of the finer details.', '2007-03-20 20:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3476258, 483310, 66384, '<td valign="top">Very interesting effect. The deep black of the oars, hair, and shirts and the two spots of red are wonderfully strong elements of the composition. I like it very much. 10</td>', 'Very interesting effect. The deep black of the oars, hair, and shirts and the two spots of red are wonderfully strong elements of the composition. I like it very much. 10', '2007-03-20 20:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
