(3476866, 481700, 49643, '<td valign="top">Well This is a piece of ancient art, the Lord Ganesha in dancing pose carved, sculptured in a ancient temple in Maharshtra, India.<br/>This God is having  elephants head &amp; having mythological stories related to it. Since it is very attractive Lord Ganesha is used frequently in paintings,Art related all things.This God is very famous in India.<br/>I thought the grain effect was matching the the natural texture of stone &amp; adding the effect.<br/>Later I applied it poster effect &amp; I thought it is much better than this, since it was basic editing I can''t use that.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-09-28 07:12:46.</i></td>', 'Well This is a piece of ancient art, the Lord Ganesha in dancing pose carved, sculptured in a ancient temple in Maharshtra, India.This God is having  elephants head & having mythological stories related to it. Since it is very attractive Lord Ganesha is used frequently in paintings,Art related all things.This God is very famous in India.I thought the grain effect was matching the the natural texture of stone & adding the effect.Later I applied it poster effect & I thought it is much better than this, since it was basic editing I can''t use that.', '2007-03-21 00:50:21.000000', '2007-09-28 08:12:46.000000', 0),
