(3478003, 482389, 24454, '<td valign="top">Deb, this another of your photos that I reeeeeeallly love!  I love everything about the urban look of the building and the street.  But the demeanor of the man pulling the suitcase is so perfect for this grainy look.   Kind of "head down, worn out".   What awesome photography!   You have had some really good finishes!  Congratulations!<br/> <br/> <br/></td>', 'Deb, this another of your photos that I reeeeeeallly love!  I love everything about the urban look of the building and the street.  But the demeanor of the man pulling the suitcase is so perfect for this grainy look.   Kind of "head down, worn out".   What awesome photography!   You have had some really good finishes!  Congratulations!  ', '2007-03-21 10:23:00.000000', NULL, 0),
