(3478009, 484023, 67697, '<td valign="top">I like grain being used to enhance that old time feel.  In your pic, I cannot tell what subject you are trying to emphasize.  There are too many objects there with the furniture and the decorative piece resting on it.  Maybe a differenct perspective - full on shot side shot of the carriage?  Nice idea!</td>', 'I like grain being used to enhance that old time feel.  In your pic, I cannot tell what subject you are trying to emphasize.  There are too many objects there with the furniture and the decorative piece resting on it.  Maybe a differenct perspective - full on shot side shot of the carriage?  Nice idea!', '2007-03-21 10:24:36.000000', NULL, 0),
