(3480820, 481813, 66597, '<td valign="top">Bob,<br/>I wondered if this one was yours when I was voting - I am starting to recognize your style. I really like the sepia/yellow toning on it, and think it was an excellent choice for this challenge. I would like to see a little more negative space in the sky, but realize a different crop might be impossible given the location. Good entry! And look at that score from your commenters!</td>', 'Bob,I wondered if this one was yours when I was voting - I am starting to recognize your style. I really like the sepia/yellow toning on it, and think it was an excellent choice for this challenge. I would like to see a little more negative space in the sky, but realize a different crop might be impossible given the location. Good entry! And look at that score from your commenters!', '2007-03-22 09:05:51.000000', NULL, 0),
