(3480871, 481080, 7889, '<td valign="top">Firstly this is a great photo, one I like very much and congratulations on your ribbon. However Looking at the image I am struggling to see that much grain in it. To me (and I have looked at it on different monitors) it seems that its more the fact that it has more ''texture'' rather than grain? <br/> <br/>Mike<br/></td>', 'Firstly this is a great photo, one I like very much and congratulations on your ribbon. However Looking at the image I am struggling to see that much grain in it. To me (and I have looked at it on different monitors) it seems that its more the fact that it has more ''texture'' rather than grain?  Mike', '2007-03-22 09:30:26.000000', NULL, 0),
