(3480992, 483179, 67152, '<td valign="top">Cool image, Steve - I liked this image in the challenge - especially the rough looking sky.  The colors are very surreal - especially with the brownish sky and the pinkish grey stone structure.  I have driven past this building countless times and thought about photographing it - but I am usually with the Fam and they would rather not sit alongside the road and wait for me - it''s the one on the hill above Old Mystic, right?  <br/> <br/>I guess now that you have claimed this building, I will need to find another ramshackled structure to photograph..<br/> <br/>Nice work.</td>', 'Cool image, Steve - I liked this image in the challenge - especially the rough looking sky.  The colors are very surreal - especially with the brownish sky and the pinkish grey stone structure.  I have driven past this building countless times and thought about photographing it - but I am usually with the Fam and they would rather not sit alongside the road and wait for me - it''s the one on the hill above Old Mystic, right?   I guess now that you have claimed this building, I will need to find another ramshackled structure to photograph.. Nice work.', '2007-03-22 10:52:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(3481022, 483797, 16241, '<td valign="top">i like it, different to your normal photos, it works well.</td>', 'i like it, different to your normal photos, it works well.', '2007-03-22 10:59:54.000000', NULL, 0),
