(3481693, 481535, 67258, '<td valign="top">Whoa, only 5.2? I loved this, and gave it a 9 - to my eyes the composition is outstanding and the background, while a little strange, compliments the photo perfectly.  The grain looks ''right'' with the photo helping to suggest cold and winter, rather than with some where it appeared as though it had just been slapped on to fit the challenge....</td>', 'Whoa, only 5.2? I loved this, and gave it a 9 - to my eyes the composition is outstanding and the background, while a little strange, compliments the photo perfectly.  The grain looks ''right'' with the photo helping to suggest cold and winter, rather than with some where it appeared as though it had just been slapped on to fit the challenge....', '2007-03-22 15:29:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(3481724, 482387, 67258, '<td valign="top">I had expected to see this much higher in the rankings (I gave a 7)!  I liked the idea, the composition, and felt the grain added a positive dimension to the image - so many entries to this challenge appeared to be good photos that had noise added to make them fit the challenge, thus ruining the photo in the process.</td>', 'I had expected to see this much higher in the rankings (I gave a 7)!  I liked the idea, the composition, and felt the grain added a positive dimension to the image - so many entries to this challenge appeared to be good photos that had noise added to make them fit the challenge, thus ruining the photo in the process.', '2007-03-22 15:37:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(3481753, 483985, 67258, '<td valign="top">''I hope somebody likes it'' - well, I did, and gave it an 8.  I can''t believe it is languishing down near the bottom of the rankings.  The soft focus was lovely, and yes, I do think the noise gave it the feel of a pointilism painting.  And I still like it, too!</td>', '''I hope somebody likes it'' - well, I did, and gave it an 8.  I can''t believe it is languishing down near the bottom of the rankings.  The soft focus was lovely, and yes, I do think the noise gave it the feel of a pointilism painting.  And I still like it, too!', '2007-03-22 15:50:28.000000', NULL, 0),
