(3483024, 481521, 65886, '<td valign="top">I like this contrast between the white/blue marine colors and the grain, I wouldn''t think they would look gerat together but they actually do here. so many details together with the noise make me want to touch the screen and the things there:) quite a strange feeling, a 3d feeling. the perspective and angle even make this 3d feeling stronger.</td>', 'I like this contrast between the white/blue marine colors and the grain, I wouldn''t think they would look gerat together but they actually do here. so many details together with the noise make me want to touch the screen and the things there:) quite a strange feeling, a 3d feeling. the perspective and angle even make this 3d feeling stronger.', '2007-03-23 07:49:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(3483037, 481813, 65886, '<td valign="top">I agree with Julianne, maybe tone down a little bit the yellow? the noise works perfectly here though, and a very nice angle you chose, it really helps to create depth.</td>', 'I agree with Julianne, maybe tone down a little bit the yellow? the noise works perfectly here though, and a very nice angle you chose, it really helps to create depth.', '2007-03-23 07:58:45.000000', NULL, 0),
