(3490612, 483308, 30982, '<td valign="top">Been meaning to get back to this one to comment.  What I really admire about your work is your vision/goal and your ability to execute (and execute very well, I might add) that goal.  I very much appreciate you taking the time to outline how you did this, too.  It was one of my top picks in the challenge.  Nice mood of isolation created here, though I don''t perceive it as sad - just solitary in a kind of content sort of way.</td>', 'Been meaning to get back to this one to comment.  What I really admire about your work is your vision/goal and your ability to execute (and execute very well, I might add) that goal.  I very much appreciate you taking the time to outline how you did this, too.  It was one of my top picks in the challenge.  Nice mood of isolation created here, though I don''t perceive it as sad - just solitary in a kind of content sort of way.', '2007-03-27 07:44:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(3490740, 482609, 65886, '<td valign="top">I liek those "lines" falling, it''s like the world is falling into pieces, and that person goes out of it all, to the right. the red is excellent. I would never think the noise can work well with images like this one, but I think here it''s wonderful, it really adds something to that falling world feeling, red lines and dirty walls.</td>', 'I liek those "lines" falling, it''s like the world is falling into pieces, and that person goes out of it all, to the right. the red is excellent. I would never think the noise can work well with images like this one, but I think here it''s wonderful, it really adds something to that falling world feeling, red lines and dirty walls.', '2007-03-27 09:59:56.000000', NULL, 0),
