(3541101, 483562, 67145, '<td valign="top">wondered wot you''d got the dq for and opened this one up .... far out and a total suck that you got the dq ..... i''v just gone and checked out some of your other work and came to your beautiful free study for march ... 25th place is awesome for a gorgeous photograph ... it would certainly make up for this unexpected and unpleasant dq .... but something i''ve noticed .....that because of the dq plenty of ppl take a look, like i did ... and you may get more ppl enjoying this stunning photograph than if it''d just been 5TH place .... well, maybe not, but it could make it feel better?? :)<br/>i gave you a 9 for this by the way ....... i can tell because of the red line!!</td>', 'wondered wot you''d got the dq for and opened this one up .... far out and a total suck that you got the dq ..... i''v just gone and checked out some of your other work and came to your beautiful free study for march ... 25th place is awesome for a gorgeous photograph ... it would certainly make up for this unexpected and unpleasant dq .... but something i''ve noticed .....that because of the dq plenty of ppl take a look, like i did ... and you may get more ppl enjoying this stunning photograph than if it''d just been 5TH place .... well, maybe not, but it could make it feel better?? :)i gave you a 9 for this by the way ....... i can tell because of the red line!!', '2007-04-11 22:03:18.000000', NULL, 0),
