(3588029, 484011, 45672, '<td valign="top">Hi Kristin, wow, this one is superb.  Great eye on this one.  I think you got hosed on your score.  This should''ve scored much higher.  Keep up the great work and I hope that we get a chance to shoot together one of these days.</td>', 'Hi Kristin, wow, this one is superb.  Great eye on this one.  I think you got hosed on your score.  This should''ve scored much higher.  Keep up the great work and I hope that we get a chance to shoot together one of these days.', '2007-04-27 11:37:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(3591431, 483829, 60862, '<td valign="top">Here''s my thinking as I looked at it: "okay, it''s an interesting shot, nice placement of the objects, what is that thing to the right WHOAH"<br/> <br/>I''m guessing that was your intent, so you were 100% successful with me. :)  And given the amazing score from your commenters, I bet they got it, too.</td>', 'Here''s my thinking as I looked at it: "okay, it''s an interesting shot, nice placement of the objects, what is that thing to the right WHOAH" I''m guessing that was your intent, so you were 100% successful with me. :)  And given the amazing score from your commenters, I bet they got it, too.', '2007-04-29 00:30:22.000000', NULL, 0),
