(3610732, 483809, 66384, '<td valign="top">Wow, congratulations on a very good score and an excellent ranking. There is some good use for noise!! I''m curious to know how you created it in this shot. I noticed the ISO is set to 100.</td>', 'Wow, congratulations on a very good score and an excellent ranking. There is some good use for noise!! I''m curious to know how you created it in this shot. I noticed the ISO is set to 100.', '2007-05-03 14:20:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(3613513, 481978, 48228, '<td valign="top">I knew I would have commented on this one as I really, really like it.<br/>I think this place could be a source of many great images, depending on the challenge..... <br/>I just love the arches receeding into the background into infinity. <br/>EXCELLENT IMAGE here, and adding it to "my favorites".....<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by sherpet:</b></div><hr/><i> This was one of my picks for the front page, and so pleased you made it..... </i></td></tr></table><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-05-04 02:06:20.</i></td>', 'I knew I would have commented on this one as I really, really like it.I think this place could be a source of many great images, depending on the challenge..... I just love the arches receeding into the background into infinity. EXCELLENT IMAGE here, and adding it to "my favorites"..... Originally posted by sherpet: This was one of my picks for the front page, and so pleased you made it..... ', '2007-05-04 03:04:40.000000', '2007-05-04 03:06:20.000000', 0),
(3626501, 483829, 73277, '<td valign="top">The comment by jclairemcphotos was right on the money. You look at the pic and see the teddy bear and think about little kids getting ready for bedtime. Then you see the hand and think "pull your feet up! Boogeyman!" I think it was a cool idea!<br/>(And your problem with the cross dress challenge really put a wierd thought in my head about E.)</td>', 'The comment by jclairemcphotos was right on the money. You look at the pic and see the teddy bear and think about little kids getting ready for bedtime. Then you see the hand and think "pull your feet up! Boogeyman!" I think it was a cool idea!(And your problem with the cross dress challenge really put a wierd thought in my head about E.)', '2007-05-07 23:04:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(3626731, 480746, 47933, '<td valign="top">Don''t know why I''ve just seen this for the first time but I''ll say that this is my favorite image in this challenge. It''s one of the few where the grain adds so much to an already wonderful capture.</td>', 'Don''t know why I''ve just seen this for the first time but I''ll say that this is my favorite image in this challenge. It''s one of the few where the grain adds so much to an already wonderful capture.', '2007-05-07 23:37:27.000000', NULL, 0),
