(3741068, 481956, 61961, '<td valign="top">Very appealing photo.  Of course the landscape isn''t flat and dry, but I''m reminded of Kansas in the early sepia scenes of Wizard of Oz!</td>', 'Very appealing photo.  Of course the landscape isn''t flat and dry, but I''m reminded of Kansas in the early sepia scenes of Wizard of Oz!', '2007-06-05 10:14:40.000000', NULL, 0),
